<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2SA" style="id">- Kwere Bible Version 2009</book>
  <para style="h">2 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Chitabu chekaidi cha Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Samweli</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Sam</para>
  <para style="mt2">Chitabu Chekaidi cha</para>
  <para style="mt1">Samweli</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Vitabu va 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli baho mwanduso vilumbilizigwa kuwa chitabu chimwe chochitangigwe Samweli. Vitabu va 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli vosimulila ugima wa mulotezi Samweli na mfalume Sauli na mfalume Daudi. Samweli kakala mulangulizi wa uhelelo lusita isi ya Isilaili viikalile yolangulizigwa na Wasemi. Samweli iyo yawahakile mavuta Sauli na Daudi kuwa wafalume wa Isilaili.</para>
  <para style="ip">Habule munhu yavimanyile yelihi yandikile vitabu vino va 1 Samweli na 2 Samweli. Munhu yandikile hatambule zina jake mwenyewo muna ivitabu ivo, mbali yodahika kakala mgima lusita lwose lwa utawala wa mfalume Daudi, hebu yodahika kakala mgima mbaka viumalile utawala uwo. Kakala na udahi wa kulola na kusoma maandiko yamwenga yosimulila ugima wa Sauli na Samweli. Kwaviya hachivimanyile yelihi yandikile vitabu vino, lelo hachivimanya kuwa vitabu vino vandikigwa zuwaki.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zilimuno muna ichitabu cha 2 Samweli</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Sula ya 1 mbaka sula ya 5 zofambula viya Daudi viyapatile kuwa mfalume wa isi ya Yuda na hamwande kawa mfalume wa Isilaili yose.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Sula ya 6 mbaka sula ya 10 zofambula viya Daudi viyatawale na kuwahuma wengi wa wehi wake.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Muna isula ya 11 mbaka sula ya 12 chosoma viya Daudi viyatendile uhasanyi wa ugoni na kukoma na viya viyazumigwe na mulotezi Nasani.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Sula ya 13 mbaka sula ya 20 zosimulila miyanza midi kusonhela wanhu walondile kumuhoka Daudi utawala wake.</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Sula ya 21 mbaka sula ya 24 ni mbuli za uhelelo kusonhela utawala wa mfalume Daudi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kohulika ifa ya Sauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 1:1" />Viifosile ifa ya Sauli, Daudi kabwela kulawa kuwakoma Waamaleki na kakala Sikilagi siku mbili. <verse eid="2SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 1:2" />Siku yeketatu, munhu imwe keza kulawa kuna dilago da Sauli, kuno viwalo vake videgeka na kana matimbwisi muna iditwi jake kulagusa kana usungu. Viyafikile kwa Daudi, kaibwanha hasi haulongozi wake kwa hishima. <verse eid="2SA 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 1:3" />Daudi kamuuza, “Weye kulawa kulihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:3">Munhu iyo kamwidika, “Nikimbila muna dilago da Waisilaili.”<verse eid="2SA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 1:4" />Daudi kamuuza, “Lelo nilongele uko kulawilila choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:4">Kamwidika, “Wanhu wakimbila ng'hondo. Wanhu wengi wadanganika. Iviya Sauli na Yonasani mwanage wadanganika.”<verse eid="2SA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 1:5" />Maabaho Daudi kamuuza mbwanga ija yezile kumulongela, “Kuvimanyaze kuwa Sauli na Yonasani mwanage wadanganika?”<verse eid="2SA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 1:6" />Mbwanga ija kamwidika, “Nikala kuna umulima wa Giliboa, uko Sauli kakala kasigamila mgoha wake na matololi ya kubululigwa na falasi na wakwelafalasi ya wehi wake ikala yomuwinga. <verse eid="2SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 1:7" />Viyahinduke kuchisogo, kaniwona na kanitanga. Nimwidika, ‘Nabaha!’ <verse eid="2SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 1:8" />Nayo kaniuza, ‘Weye iyo yelihi?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:8">“Nimwidika, ‘Niye Mwamaleki.’<verse eid="2SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 1:9" />“Maabaho kanilongela, ‘Kwenhuka hano unikome, kwaviya nina mawine ng'hani, mbali ning'hali mgima.’<verse eid="2SA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 1:10" />“Ivo nimkwenhukila habehi na nimkoma, kwaviya nivimanya kuwa yahagwa hadaha kuwa mgima. Maabaho nisola kombelo dikalile muna iditwi jake na kung'hu dikalile muna umkono wake, vose nikugalila weye, mwenevale wangu.”<verse eid="2SA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 1:11" />Daudi kavidega viwalo vake kwa usungu, iviya walume wose wakalile hamwe nayo kawatendela ivo. <verse eid="2SA 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 1:12" />Walila na wafunga kuja mbaka ichigulogulo kwa ichimu cha Sauli na Yonasani, na kwa ichimu cha watowang'hondo wa Mndewa Mulungu na wanhu wa Isilaili, kwaviya wengi wawo wakomigwa kuna ing'hondo.<verse eid="2SA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 1:13" />Daudi kamuuza mbwanga ija yezile kumulongela mbuli izo, “Weye kolawa kulihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 1:13">Nayo kamwidika, “Niye Mwamaleki, mbali nokala muna isi yako fana mkaya.”<verse eid="2SA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 1:14" />Daudi kamuuza, “Iwaze hudumbile kumkoma munhu yasaguligwe na Mndewa Mulungu?”<verse eid="2SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 1:15" />Maabaho Daudi kamtanga imwe wa wabwanga wake, kamulongela, “Hita ukamkome iyo!” Ivo kamkanha na panga na kadanganika. <verse eid="2SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 1:16" />Viyakalile kodanganika, Daudi kamulongela Mwamaleki iyo, “Ifa yako iwe kumwako weye mwenyewo, kwaviya kuilongeleza mwenyewo, kulonga, ‘Nimkoma munhu yasaguligwe na Mndewa Mulungu.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi kowalilila Sauli na Yonasani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 1:17" />Daudi kamulilila Sauli na Yonasani mwanage, kemba vino, <verse eid="2SA 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 1:18" />na kalonga kuwa yolondeka wanhu wa Yuda wafunzigwe kwimba Wila wa Upinde. Yandikigwa muna ichitabu cha Yashali, kalonga,<verse eid="2SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 1:19" />“Ukulu wako weye Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:19">ukomigwa kuna imilima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:19">Magalu wagwa!<verse eid="2SA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 1:20" />“Sekemuzilonge mbuli zino uko Gasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">sekemuzigong'onde muna zinzila za Ashikeloni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">muladi wandele wa Wafilisiti sekewadeng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:20">wandele wa waja hawagumigwe ulungwana sekewatowe ng'henze.<verse eid="2SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 1:21" />“Milima ya Giliboa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">sekeiwe na nhungwe hebu mvula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">na migunda sekeime mhule za nhosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">kwaviya uko niuko kozasigwe ngao za wene nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:21">ngao ya Sauli, haibobodigwe mavuta kaidi.<verse eid="2SA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 1:22" />Upinde wa Yonasani ukala na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">panga da Sauli difikizigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">ziwakoma wehi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:22">ziwakoma magalu.<verse eid="2SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 1:23" />“Sauli na Yonasani walondigwa na wanhu na wanogeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">hawabaguligwe viwakalile wagima hebu viwadanganike.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">Wakala wahuha kufosa masumula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:23">wakala na nguvu kufosa simba.<verse eid="2SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 1:24" />“Mweye wanaake wa Isilaili mulilileni Sauli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">yoyamvazileni mawalo madung'hu yanogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:24">na kayahamba zahabu mawalo yenu.<verse eid="2SA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 1:25" />“Magalu wagwa kuna ing'hondo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:25">Yonasani kakomigwa kuna imilima.<verse eid="2SA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 1:26" />Niwona usungu kwa ichimu chako, ndugu yangu Yonasani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">kukala mbwiyangu ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">Ulondo wako kumwangu ukala wa mwazanyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:26">kufosa ulondo wa wanaake.<verse eid="2SA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 1:27" />“Magalu wagwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 1:27">via vawo va ng'hondo vaga!”<verse eid="2SA 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2SA 2" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kohakigwa mavuta kuwa mfalume wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 2:1" />Vizifosile mbuli izo, Daudi kamuuza Mndewa Mulungu, “Vino nihite bululu dimwe muna yamabululu yeli Yuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Mndewa Mulungu kamwidika, “Hita.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Daudi kamuuza, “Nihite bululu dilihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:1">Mndewa Mulungu kamwidika, “Hita bululu da Hebuloni.” <verse eid="2SA 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 2:2" />Ivo Daudi kahita Hebuloni hamwe na wake zake waidi, Ahinoamu yalawile Yezileeli na Abigaili mgane wa Nabali yalawile Kalimeli. <verse eid="2SA 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 2:3" />Daudi kawasola wanhu wakalile hamwe nayo, chila munhu na kaye yake. Wakala muna dibululu da Hebuloni na vibululu vake. <verse eid="2SA 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 2:4" />Maabaho wanhu wa kabila da Yuda weza Hebuloni na kumuhaka mavuta Daudi muladi yawe mfalume wawo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:4">Daudi viyalongeligwe kuwa wanhu wa Yabeshi Gileadi wawo wamuwandile Sauli, <verse eid="2SA 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 2:5" />Daudi katuma wasenga kwa wanhu wa Yabeshi Gileadi, kawalongela, “Mndewa Mulungu yamtemeleni mate, kwaviya mumtendela vinogile Sauli mwenevale wenu kwa kumuwanda. <verse eid="2SA 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 2:6" />Lelo Mndewa Mulungu yamulaguseni ulondo wa kufunya umoyo na waminika, niye iviya nizamulagusani unovu kwaviya mutenda mbuli iyo. <verse eid="2SA 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 2:7" />Ivo muwe wagangamavu na magalu, kwaviya Sauli mwenevale wenu kadanganika na wanhu wa kabila da Yuda wanihaka mavuta niwe mfalume wawo.”<verse eid="2SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishiboshesi kotendigwa kuwa mfalume wa Isilaili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 2:8" />Abineli mwana wa Neli, mkulu wa watowang'hondo wa Sauli, kakala kamsola Ishiboshesi mwana wa Sauli na kumgala uko Mahanaimu. <verse eid="2SA 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 2:9" />Kamtenda Ishiboshesi yawe mfalume wa isi ya Gileadi na Asheli na Yezileeli na Efulaimu na Benyamini na Isilaili yose. <verse eid="2SA 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 2:10" />Ishiboshesi mwana wa Sauli kakala na miyaka malongo mane viyatendigwe kuwa mfalume wa Isilaili. Kalanguliza miyaka midi, mbali kabila da Yuda wamsondelela Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 2:11" />Daudi kakala mfalume wa kabila da Yuda uko Hebuloni kwa miyaka saba na miyezi sita.<verse eid="2SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'hondo ya wanhu wa Isilaili na wanhu wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 2:12" />Abineli mwana wa Neli, hamwe na wasang'hani wa Ishiboshesi mwana wa Sauli, wasegela bululu da Mahanaimu wahita bululu da Gibeoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 2:13" />Yoabu yelekigwe na mwanamke Seluya na wasang'hani wa Daudi, walawa kuhita kuiting'hana nawo habehi na sima da Gibeoni, wamwenga wakala ubanzi uno na wamwenga ubanzi uja wa chisima.<verse eid="2SA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 2:14" />Abineli kamulongela Yoabu, “Walekelele wabwanga kulawa chila ubanzi waitowe mkono kwa mkono haulongozi wetu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:14">Yoabu kamwidika, “Vinoga, waleke watende ivo.”<verse eid="2SA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 2:15" />Ivo wasegela, wahita kuumwambu wa chisima icho, peta yawo wakala wanhu longo na waidi ubanzi wa Ishiboshesi mwana wa Sauli kulawa kabila da Benyamini na, wanhu longo na waidi ubanzi wa Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 2:16" />Chila munhu kagwila muna iditwi da miyage na kumkanha na panga muna ulubavu lwa miyage na wadanganika hamwe. Hanhu baho uko Gibeoni hatangigwa Helikasi Hasulimu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Helikasi Hasulimu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiyebulaniya fambulo jake hanhu ha panga.</char></note>.<verse eid="2SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 2:17" />Ng'hondo ya siku iyo ikala ng'hulu ng'hani. Abineli na wanhu wa Isilaili watowigwa na watowang'hondo wa Daudi mbaka wapotwa. <verse eid="2SA 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 2:18" />Wana watatu wa Seluya iviya wakala uko, Yoabu na Abishai na Asaheli. Asaheli kadaha kukimbila fana mhala. <verse eid="2SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 2:19" />Asaheli kamuwinga Abineli bila kubaguka ukulume hebu ukumoso. <verse eid="2SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 2:20" />Abineli kahinduka kuchisogo, kamuuza, “Vino weye Asaheli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 2:20">Nayo kamwidika, “Iyo niye.”<verse eid="2SA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 2:21" />Abineli kamulongela, “Leka kuniwinga niye, hinduka ukulume hebu ukumoso umgwile mbwanga imwenga na uvisole viya vake va ng'hondo.” Mbali Asaheli hatogole kuhinduka na halekile kumuwinga.<verse eid="2SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 2:22" />Abineli kamulongela Asaheli mwanza wekaidi, “Leka kuniwinga! Habali nikukome? Nizamulolaze sekulu wako Yoabu muna ichihanga?”<verse eid="2SA 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 2:23" />Mbali Asaheli kalema kuhinduka. Ivo Abineli kamuhoma muna umunda na nhonga ya mgoha wake kwa kuchisogo na umgoha ulawila kumgongo wa Asaheli. Asaheli kagwa hasi na kadanganika bahobaho. Wanhu wose wafikile baho hoyagwile Asaheli na kudanganika, wema.<verse eid="2SA 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 2:24" />Mbali Yoabu na Abishai wamuwinga Abineli, zuwa vidingile wafika kuna umulima wa Ama, ukalile ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa wa Giya, kuna inzila ihita kuichuwala cha Gibeoni. <verse eid="2SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 2:25" />Wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini waiduganya hamwe kuilumba na Abineli, wawa chibumbila chimwe, wema uchanyha ya mulima.<verse eid="2SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 2:26" />Maabaho Abineli kamtanga Yoabu, kalonga, “Vino chizaitowa siku zose? Vino huwona kuwa uhelelo wake wizakuwa usungu? Vino zuwaki kwizawalongela wanhu wako waleke kuwawinga ndugu zawo?”<verse eid="2SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 2:27" />Yoabu kalonga, “Fana Mulungu viyokala, one hulongile ivo, wanhu wahagendelele kuwawinga ndugu zawo mbaka igolo imitondo.”<verse eid="2SA 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 2:28" />Ivo Yoabu katowa mhalati na wanhu wose wema, waleka kuwawinga Waisilaili na hawaitowile kaidi.<verse eid="2SA 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 2:29" />Abineli na wanhu wake wafosa kolongo da Alaba ichilo chose, waloka lwanda lwa Yoludani, wagendelela imitondo yose mbaka wafika Mahanaimu.<verse eid="2SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 2:30" />Yoabu kabwela kulawa kumuwinga Abineli na kawaduganya hamwe wanhu wake wose na kawapeta. Watowang'hondo wa Daudi wahunguka longo na kenda hamwe na Asaheli. <verse eid="2SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 2:31" />Mbali watowang'hondo wa Daudi wawakoma wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini magana matatu na malongo sita wowakalilile hamwe na Abineli. <verse eid="2SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 2:32" />Yoabu na wanhu wake wasola mtufi wa Asaheli na wauwanda kuna dileme da tati yake uko Beselehemu. Maabaho wagenda ichilo chose na chilochilo wafika kuna dibululu da Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 2:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2SA 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 3:1" />Kukala na ng'hondo ya siku nyingi hagati ya wanhu wa ubanzi wa Daudi na wanhu wa ubanzi wa Sauli. Wanhu wa ubanzi wa Daudi wagendelela kuwa na nguvu, mbali wanhu wa ubanzi wa Sauli wagendelela kuwa nyondenyonde.<verse eid="2SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa chilume wa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 3:2" />Wano ni wana wa chilume welekigwe na Daudi uko Hebuloni. Mwana wa udele kakala Aminoni, mami yake kakala Ahinoamu wa uko Yezileeli. <verse eid="2SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 3:3" />Wekaidi kakala Chileabu mwana wa Abigaili, mkefilwa wa Nabali kulawa Kalimeli, weketatu kakala Abisalomu mami yake katangigwa Maaka mndele wa Talimai, mfalume wa Geshuli. <verse eid="2SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 3:4" />Wekane kakala Adoniya mwana wa Hagisi na wetano kakala Shefatia mami yake katangigwa Abitali. <verse eid="2SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 3:5" />Wesita kakala Isileamu mwana wa muke imwenga wa Daudi yatangigwe Egila. Wawo wose welekigwa na Daudi uko Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abineli komuhitila Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 3:6" />Ng'hondo viikalile yogendelela hagati ya wanhu wa ubanzi wa Sauli na wanhu wa ubanzi wa Daudi, Abineli kongeza nguvu kwa wanhu wa Sauli. <verse eid="2SA 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 3:7" />Sauli viyakalile mgima kakala na muke mdodo yatangigwe Lisipa, mndele wa Aya. Ishiboshesi kamuuza Abineli, “Habali kumbandama muke mdodo wa tati yangu?”<verse eid="2SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 3:8" />Abineli kawona ludoko ng'hani kwa mbuli za Ishiboshesi, kalonga. “Vino kogesa nowasang'hanila wanhu wa Yuda? Lola, mbaka diyelo nilagusa ulondo kwa wanhu wa tati yako Sauli na ndugu zake na mbwiya zake. Sikugumile muna yamakono ya Daudi, mbali ung'hali konilonga vihile kuwa niye mbananzi kwa ichimu cha mwanamke ino. <verse eid="2SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 3:9" />Mulungu yanitaguse na kunikoma, one simtendele Daudi fana viyalahiligwe na Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="2SA 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 3:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulahila Daudi kuwa kezauhamiza ufalume kulawa kwa wanhu wa Sauli na kugangamiza ufalume wa Daudi kwa Isilaili na Yuda, kwandusila Dani mbaka Belisheba.” <verse eid="2SA 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 3:11" />Ishiboshesi halongile mbuli kwa Abineli, kwaviya kakala komdumba.<verse eid="2SA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 3:12" />Ivo Abineli katuma wasenga kwa Daudi wakamulongele, “Vino isi ino ya yelihi? Tenda lagano na niye, nizakutaza kuitenda Isilaili yose itawaligwe na weye.”<verse eid="2SA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 3:13" />Daudi kalonga, “Vinoga! Nizatenda lagano na weye. Mbali nolonda mbuli imwe kumwako, hwizaniwona kaidi mbaka unigalile Mikali mndele wa Sauli, baho kwizaniwona.” <verse eid="2SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 3:14" />Maabaho Daudi katuma wasenga kwa Ishiboshesi mwana wa Sauli, kalonga, “Nibwelezele muke wangu Mikali yonimsolile kwa magovi gana ya Wafilisiti.”<verse eid="2SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 3:15" />Ivo Ishiboshesi katuma wanhu wakamsole Mikali kulawa kwa mulumake Palitieli, mwana wa Laisha. <verse eid="2SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 3:16" />Mulumake kahita hamwe nayo kuno kolila, kamsondelela mbaka Bahulimu. Baho Abineli kamulongela Palitieli, “Bwela ukaye.” Nayo kabwela.<verse eid="2SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 3:17" />Abineli kalonga na walala wa Isilaili, kalonga, “Kwa lusita lukulu mulonda kumtenda Daudi yawe mfalume wenu. <verse eid="2SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 3:18" />Lelo tendeni vino, kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Daudi, ‘Kwa kufosela weye msang'hani wangu Daudi nizawalopola wanhu wangu Isilaili kulawa muna yamakono ya Wafilisiti na kulawa muna yamakono ya wehi wawo wose.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 3:19" />Iviya Abineli kalonga na wanhu wa kabila da Benyamini, maabaho kahita kulonga na Daudi uko Hebuloni mbuli zose ziwoneke kuwa zinoga kwa kabila da Benyamini na Waisilaili wamwenga.<verse eid="2SA 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 3:20" />Abineli hamwe na wanhu malongo maidi, wamuhitila Daudi uko Hebuloni na Daudi kawatendela dugila. <verse eid="2SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 3:21" />Abineli kamulongela Daudi, “Nisondelele sambi nohita yodahika kukugalila wanhu wose wa Isilaili, weye mwenevale wangu mfalume. Wezakwiza na kutenda lagano na weye, muladi uwe mfalume wawo na weye kwizawatawala wose fana viya viulonda.” Nayo Daudi kamuleka Abineli yahite kwa tindiwalo.<verse eid="2SA 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abineli kokomigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 3:22" />Watowang'hondo wa Daudi wabwela kulawa kuna ing'hondo hamwe na Yoabu, wabwela na vinhu vingi viwahokile, mbali Abineli hakalile Hebuloni kwa Daudi kwaviya Daudi kamtuma yahite, nayo kahita kwa tindiwalo. <verse eid="2SA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 3:23" />Yoabu viyabwelile hamwe na watowang'hondo wowokalile hamwe nayo, kalongiligwa kuwa Abineli mwana wa Neli, kakala yezile kumuwona mfalume Daudi, nayo kamulaga yahite, nayo kasegela kwa tindiwalo.<verse eid="2SA 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 3:24" />Ivo Yoabu kamuhitila mfalume na kumulongela, “Vino kutenda choni? Lola Abineli keza kumwako. Habali kumuleka yahite? Lelo kasegela! <verse eid="2SA 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 3:25" />Vino kuvimanya kuwa Abineli mwana wa Neli keza kukuvwizila? Keza muladi yavimanye kwingila kwako na kulawa kwako na yavimanye chila chinhu choutenda.”<verse eid="2SA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 3:26" />Yoabu viyalawile kulonga na Daudi, katuma wasenga wamgale Abineli, nawo wamfika kuna ichisima cha Sila na kumbweleza, mbali Daudi haimanyile bule mbuli iyo. <verse eid="2SA 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 3:27" />Abineli viyabwelile Hebuloni, Yoabu kamsola hamgwazo kuna ulwivi lukulu lwa bululu fana viya kolonda kulonga nayo chiidumwe. Na kamuhoma kwa mgoha Abineli mmunda. Yoabu kamkoma Abineli kwaviya Abineli kamkoma Asaheli mdodo wake.<verse eid="2SA 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 3:28" />Hamwande Daudi viyahulike mbuli izo kalonga, “Niye na ufalume wangu kweli chabule ubananzi siku zose haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu kusonhela kukomigwa kwa Abineli mwana wa Neli. <verse eid="2SA 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 3:29" />Ukomaji uwo uwe ubananzi wake Yoabu na kaye yose ya tati yake! Kaye ya Yoabu sekeiswele munhu yolawigwa na ufila hebu yeli na utamu wa dikulu hebu yogendela mhome hebu mwene kukomigwa kwa panga hebu mwene kulonda ndiya!”<verse eid="2SA 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 3:30" />Yoabu na Abishai ndugu yake wamkoma Abineli kwaviya kamkoma ndugu yawo Asaheli kuna ing'hondo uko Gibeoni.<verse eid="2SA 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi komulilila Abineli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 3:31" />Daudi kamulongela Yoabu na wanhu wose wakalile hamwe nayo, “Vuleni mawalo yenu, mukayawale mawalo ya maguniya, mudilongolele jeneza da Abineli na kuno momulilila.” Mfalume Daudi kagenda kadisondelela jeneza. <verse eid="2SA 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 3:32" />Wamuwanda Abineli uko Hebuloni. Mfalume kalila kwa kulandula dizi habehi na leme da Abineli. Iviya wanhu wose walila.<verse eid="2SA 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 3:33" />Mfalume kamulilila Abineli kuno kolombokeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:33">“Vino ilondeka Abineli yakomigwe fana viya viyokomigwa mbananzi?<verse eid="2SA 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 3:34" />Makono yake hayafungigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:34">na migulu yake haigumigwe mhingu fana mbananzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 3:34">kadanganika fana viyodanganika munhu haulongozi wa wanhu wehi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 3:34">Na wanhu wose wamulilila kaidi.<verse eid="2SA 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 3:35" />Maabaho wose weza kumulamba Daudi yaje ndiya ing'hali imisi, mbali Daudi kailaha, kalonga, “Mulungu yanikome one nihalanza gate hebu chinhu chochose ding'hali zuwa hadinakuswa!”<verse eid="2SA 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 3:36" />Wanhu wose wayawona yayo yawanogela fana viya chila chinhu choyatendile mfalume. <verse eid="2SA 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 3:37" />Ivo siku iyo wanhu wose na Waisilaili wose wavimanya kuwa mfalume halagilize Abineli mwana wa Neli yakomigwe.<verse eid="2SA 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 3:38" />Maabaho mfalume kawalongela wasang'hani wake, “Hamuvimanyile kuwa diyelo mulangulizi mkulu kadanganika muna iisi ya Isilaili? <verse eid="2SA 3:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 3:39" />Niye nihakigwa mavuta niwe mfalume, mbali diyelo niwa nyondenyonde. Kwaviya wana wa Seluya wana nguvu kufosa niye, Mndewa Mulungu yawahume wehi wano kwa kusondelela sang'hano zawo zihile!”<verse eid="2SA 3:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2SA 4" />
  <para style="s">Ishiboshesi kokomigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 4:1" />Ishiboshesi, mwana wa Sauli viyahulike kuwa Abineli kadanganika uko Hebuloni, kafa moyo na Waisilaili wose wadumba. <verse eid="2SA 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 4:2" />Ishiboshesi kakala na wanhu waidi wowakalile walangulizi wa vibumbila va watowang'hondo, zina da imwenga katangigwa Baana na zina da wekaidi katangigwa Lekabu, wanage Limoni, munhu wa kabila da Benyamini kulawa bululu da Beelosi. Beelosi ikala hanhu ha kabila da Benyamini. <verse eid="2SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 4:3" />Wanhu wa Beelosi wakimbilila Gitaimu, uko wokala fana nyambenyambe mbaka diyelo.<verse eid="2SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 4:4" />Yonasani mwana wa Sauli kakala na mwana yakalile mbetembete. Sauli na Yonasani viwadanganike uko Yezileeli, mwana iyo kakala na miyaka mitano. Yaya wake viyahulike mbuli iyo, kamsola na kakimbila. Kakimbila himahima kamulagaza imwana, nayo kawa mbetembete. Mwana iyo zina jake katangigwa Mefiboshesi.<verse eid="2SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 4:5" />Lelo Lekabu na Baana wana wa Limoni kulawa bululu da Beelosi, wahita ukaye kwa Ishiboshesi, lusita lwa zuwa da imisi viyakalile kohumula. <verse eid="2SA 4:5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="2SA 4:6-7" />Wengila muna ikaye waitenda fana wolonda kusola ngano, wamfika Ishiboshesi kagona muna ichiheleto chake cha kugona, wamuhoma muna umunda. Viwamkomile, wasola iditwi wasegela najo. Wafosela nzila ya Alaba, wagenda chilo chose. <verse eid="2SA 4:6-7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 4:8" />Wamgalila Daudi ditwi da Ishiboshesi uko Hebuloni. Wamulongela mfalume, “Lola dino ditwi da Ishiboshesi mwana wa mwihi wako Sauli yalondile kukukoma. Mndewa Mulungu kamulihiliza chisasi kusonhela Sauli na welesi wake.”<verse eid="2SA 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 4:9" />Daudi kawedika Lekabu na Baana wana wa Limoni kulawa bululu da Beelosi, kawalongela, “Noilaha kwa Mndewa Mulungu yanilopole muna yamagayo yose, <verse eid="2SA 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 4:10" />munhu imwe viyanilongele, ‘Sauli kadanganika,’ kagesa kuwa kagala usenga unogile, nimgwila na nimkoma uko Sikilagi. Yayo niiyo maliho yonimulihile kwa usenga wake! <verse eid="2SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 4:11" />Maliho yenu yezafosa maliho ya msenga ija. Mumkoma munhu yanogile muna dikomwa jake mwenyewo. Nizawalihiliza mweye chisasi na kuwasegeza muna iisi.” <verse eid="2SA 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 4:12" />Ivo Daudi kawalagiliza wasang'hani wake wawakome Lekabu na Baana, nawo wawakoma. Wawakanha migulu yawo na makono yawo, maabaho wawatumbika mumgwazo mwa sima uko Hebuloni. Mbali wadisola ditwi da Ishiboshesi na wadiwanda kuna dileme da Abineli uko Hebuloni.<verse eid="2SA 4:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2SA 5" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kohakigwa mavuta kuwa mfalume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 5:1" />Baho makabila yose ya Isilaili wamuhitila Daudi uko Hebuloni na wamulongela, “Lola cheye cha damu imwe. <verse eid="2SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 5:2" />Umwaka Sauli viyakalile mfalume, weye niiyo uwalongoze watowang'hondo wa Isilaili kuing'hondo. Mndewa Mulungu kakulongela, ‘Kwizawadima wanhu wangu Waisilaili na kwizakuwa mtawala wawo.’ ” <verse eid="2SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 5:3" />Ivo walala wose wa Isilaili wahita kwa mfalume Daudi uko Hebuloni. Nayo katenda nawo lagano haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu. Wamuhaka mavuta Daudi yawe mfalume wa Isilaili. <verse eid="2SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 5:4" />Daudi kawa na lika da miyaka malongo matatu baho viyawile mfalume na katawala miyaka malongo mane. <verse eid="2SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 5:5" />Uko Hebuloni katawala Yuda kwa miyaka saba na miyezi sita na muna Yelusalemu katawala isi ya Isilaili na Yuda miyaka malongo matatu na nhatu.<verse eid="2SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 5:6" />Maabaho mfalume na wanhu wake wahita Yelusalemu kuitowa na Wayebusi wowakalile wakaya wa isi iyo. Wayebusi wamulongela Daudi, “Hwizakwingila hano, hata vipofu na mbetembete wodaha kukuwinga,” kwaviya wagesa Daudi hadaha kwingila muna dibululu diya.<verse eid="2SA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 5:7" />Mbali Daudi kaisola mhongono ya Sayuni, sambi dotangigwa bululu da Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 5:8" />Siku ija Daudi kawalongela wanhu wake, “Yoyose yondayawahume Wayebusi, yasang'hanile hanhu baho hoyokulumila mazi muladi kuwatowa waja wowaitangile ‘vipofu na mbetembete.’ ” Lekamana wanhu wolonga, “Vipofu na mbetembete hawezakwingila muna ikaye ya mfalume.”<verse eid="2SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 5:9" />Daudi kakala muna imhongono iyo na kaitanga mhongono iyo bululu da Daudi. Kazenga mhongono kuzunguluka bululu ijo, kwandusila Milo na kwingila mgati. <verse eid="2SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 5:10" />Na Daudi kaiyoha kuwa na nguvu ya kutawala, kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kakala hamwe nayo.<verse eid="2SA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 5:11" />Mfalume Hilamu wa Tilo katuma wasenga kwa Daudi. Iviya, kawatuma waselemala wagalile magogo ya mibiki ya mielezi na wasongola mabwe. Nawo wamzengela kaye Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 5:12" />Ivo Daudi kavimanya kuwa Mndewa Mulungu kamgangamiza yawe mfalume wa Isilaili na kautemela mate ufalume wake kwa ichimu cha wanhu wake Waisilaili.<verse eid="2SA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 5:13" />Viyasegele Hebuloni, Daudi kasola wake wadodo wamwenga uko Yelusalemu na wana wa chilume na wa chike welekigwa kumwake. <verse eid="2SA 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 5:14" />Yano mazina ya wose wowalekigwe kumwake uko Yelusalemu, Shamua na Shobabu na Nasani na Sulemani <verse eid="2SA 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 5:15" />na Ibihali na Elishua na Nefegi na Yafiya <verse eid="2SA 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 5:16" />na Elishama na Eliada na Elifeleti.<verse eid="2SA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi kowahuma Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 5:17" />Wafilisiti viwahulike kuwa Daudi kahakigwa mavuta kuwa mfalume wa Isilaili, wose weza kumzahila Daudi. Mbali Daudi kahulika mbuli iyo na kengila muna imhong'hono. <verse eid="2SA 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 5:18" />Wafilisiti wafika kuna dibawe da Lefaimu na kupwililika. <verse eid="2SA 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 5:19" />Daudi kamuuza Mndewa Mulungu, “Vino nihite nikawatowe Wafilisiti? Vino kwizawaguma muna yamakono yangu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 5:19">Mndewa Mulungu kamwidika, “Genda, kwaviya kweli nizawaguma Wafilisiti muna yamakono yako.”<verse eid="2SA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 5:20" />Daudi kahita Baali Pelasimu na kuwahuma Wafilisiti. Kalonga, “Mndewa Mulungu kafosa haludonho wa wehi wangu fana mazi mengi yokuluma kwa nguvu.” Ivo hanhu baho hatangigwa Baali Pelasimu. <verse eid="2SA 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 5:21" />Wafilisiti waleka nyang'hiti zawo za milungu hanhu baho, Daudi na wanhu wake wazisola na wasegela nazo.<verse eid="2SA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 5:22" />Wafilisiti wabwela kuna dibawe da Lefaimu na kupwililika. <verse eid="2SA 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 5:23" />Daudi viyamuuzile Mndewa Mulungu yatende choni, Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela, “Sekeuwatowe kulawa baho hauli, wazunguluke na kuwatowa kulawa habehi na mibiki ya mifolosadi. <verse eid="2SA 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 5:24" />Uhahulika dizi dolawa kuna zinhembeti za mibiki ya mifolosadi dohulikika fana sindo za watowang'hondo, genda himahima ukawatowe, kwaviya iyo yolagusa kuwa Mndewa Mulungu kakulongolela kuditowa bumbila da watowang'hondo da Wafilisiti.” <verse eid="2SA 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 5:25" />Daudi katenda fana viya Mndewa Mulungu viyamulongele, nayo kawatowa Wafilisiti kulawa Geba mbaka mwiinzila ihita Gezeli.<verse eid="2SA 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2SA 6" />
  <para style="s">Sanduku da lagano dogaligwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 6:1" />Kaidi Daudi kawaduganya waja watowang'hondo magalu wa Isilaili, peta yawo maelufu malongo matatu. <verse eid="2SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 6:2" />Daudi kasegela kahita na wanhu wake wose wowakalile hamwe nayo kulawa Baala ya Yuda, muladi kudigala sanduku da lagano ditangigwe kwa zina da Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi wose, yoyokala uchanyha ya makelubi muna disanduku ijo. <verse eid="2SA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 6:3" />Wadisola sanduku da lagano da Mulungu kulawa muna ikaye ya Abinadabu yoyakalile kuna umulima na wadipapa muna ditololi da sambi. Uza na Ahiyo wana wa Abinadabu wakala wowalongoza ng'ombe wakalile wobulula tololi ijo <verse eid="2SA 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 6:4" />dili na sanduku da lagano da Mulungu uchanyha yake. Ahiyo kakala yogenda haulongozi hake. <verse eid="2SA 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 6:5" />Daudi na wanhu wose wa Isilaili wakala wovina na kwimba nyila kwa nguvu zawo zose haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu. Watowa via va nyila, fana viya chinubi na bango na mbugi na kayamba na mbilinge.<verse eid="2SA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 6:6" />Viwafikile hanhu ha kubigila ndiya ha Nakoni, Uza kaugolosa mkono wake na kujamha sanduku da lagano kwaviya ng'ombe waikwala. <verse eid="2SA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 6:7" />Mndewa Mulungu kamuwonela ludoko Uza kwa chiya chiyatendile. Mulungu kamkoma Uza baho hamgwazo ha sanduku da lagano da Mulungu. <verse eid="2SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 6:8" />Daudi kengilwa na ludoko kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kamkoma Uza. Ivo hanhu baho hotangigwa Pelesi Uza.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pelesi Uza </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulania fambulo jake nhaguso ya Uza.</char></note><verse eid="2SA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 6:9" />Daudi kamdumba Mndewa Mulungu siku ija na kalonga, “Nodahaze kudigala sanduku da lagano kumwangu?” <verse eid="2SA 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 6:10" />Ivo Daudi halondile kudigala sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu mbaka muna dibululu jake, mbali kadigala muna ikaye ya Obedi Edomu, Mgiti. <verse eid="2SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 6:11" />Ivo sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu kadiguma muna ikaye ya Obedi Edomu, Mgiti kwa lusita lwa miyezi mitatu. Mndewa Mulungu kamtemela mate Obedi Edomu na wanhu wa kaye yake.<verse eid="2SA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 6:12" />Mfalume Daudi kahulika kuwa kwa ichimu cha sanduku da lagano, Mndewa Mulungu kamtemela mate Obedi Edomu na kaye yake na vose viyakalile navo. Ivo Daudi kahita kudisola sanduku da lagano kulawa kwiikaye ya Obedi Edomu mbaka Yelusalemu kwa chelekocheleko ng'hulu. <verse eid="2SA 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 6:13" />Wanhu wakalile wopapa sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu viwamalile kuhita hatua sita, Daudi kachinja ng'ombe lume na dang'ang'a dinenehe. <verse eid="2SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 6:14" />Daudi kuno kaifunga chizibawo cha mkulu wa nhambiko mchigudi chake, kavina kwa nguvu zake zose haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="2SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 6:15" />Ivo Daudi na Waisilaili wose wadigala sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu kwa chelekocheleko na dizi kulu da mhalati.<verse eid="2SA 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 6:16" />Sanduku da lagano vidikalile dokwingila muna dibululu da Daudi, Mikali mndele wa Sauli kasungulila muna dizonzo na viyamuwone mfalume Daudi kovina na kozumhazumha haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu kamwehula. <verse eid="2SA 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 6:17" />Na wadingiza sanduku da lagano na wadika hanhu hake muna dihema diya diyazengile Daudi kwa ichimu chake. Nayo Daudi kalava nhambiko za kutimbula na nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="2SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 6:18" />Baho Daudi viyakomeleze kulava nhambiko za kutimbula na nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo, kawatemela mate wanhu kwa zina da Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi. <verse eid="2SA 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 6:19" />Kawagolela wanhu wose wa bumbila da Isilaili, walume na wanaake, chila imwe gate da ngano na unde da nyama na chibugulu cha zabibu zinyalile. Maabaho wanhu wose wabwela muizikaye zawo.<verse eid="2SA 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 6:20" />Daudi viyabwelile kuwatemela mate wanhu wa ikaye yake, Mikali mndele wa Sauli kalawa kunze kumuhowela Daudi. Kalonga, “Diyelo mfalume wa Isilaili kailagusa kuwa mbunye, koigubula nyawalo zake haulongozi wa watumwa wa chike wa wasang'hani wake bila chinyala, kalinga munhu mbozi voyotenda!”<verse eid="2SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 6:21" />Daudi kamulongela Mikali, “Nitenda ivo haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu yanisagule niye hanhu ha tati yako hebu welesi wake hebu umwenga wowose kulawa muna ikaye yake, muladi kunika niwe mulangulizi wa Waisilaili, wanhu wake Mndewa Mulungu. Ivo niye nizavina haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="2SA 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 6:22" />Nizazehigwa kufosa vino. Kodaha kugesa niye siyo chinhu, mbali watumwa waja wa chike woulonga nawo wezanihishimu!”<verse eid="2SA 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 6:23" />Ivo Mikali mndele wa Sauli kadanganika bila ya kupata mwana yoyose.<verse eid="2SA 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2SA 7" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu komulaganila Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 7:1" />Lusita mfalume Daudi viyakalile muna ikaye yake, Mndewa Mulungu kamwing'ha tindiwalo, sekeyasovuligwe na wehi wake wamzunguluke chila ubanzi. <verse eid="2SA 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 7:2" />Hamala baho mfalume kamulongela mulotezi Nasani, “Hano hanili nokala muna ikaye inogile izengigwe kwa mibiki ya mielezi, mbali sanduku da lagano da Mulungu dokala muna dihema!”<verse eid="2SA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 7:3" />Nasani kamwidika mfalume, “Hita ukatende chochose chouchigesa muna umoyo wako, kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kahamwe na weye.” <verse eid="2SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 7:4" />Mbali ichilo icho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Nasani, <verse eid="2SA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 7:5" />“Hita ukamulongele msang'hani wangu Daudi, Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, ‘Vino weye kodaha kunizengela kaye ya kukala? <verse eid="2SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 7:6" />Kwaviya niye sikalile muna ikaye kwandusila siku ija viniwalavile Waisilaili muna iisi ya Misili mbaka diyelo, mbali nilawa hanhu hamwe kuhita hanhu hamwenga na kukala muna dihema. <verse eid="2SA 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 7:7" />Chila hanhu honihitile na Waisilaili, silongile na wasemi wa Waisilaili waja niwalagilize wawadime wanhu wangu Isilaili, “Habali hamunizengele kaye kwa mibiki ya mielezi?” ’<verse eid="2SA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 7:8" />“Lelo mulongele msang'hani wangu Daudi kuwa Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi kolonga, ‘Nikulava koukalile kodima ng'hondolo muladi uwatawale wanhu wangu Waisilaili. <verse eid="2SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 7:9" />Kusongela lusita ulo niwa hamwe na weye kokose kouhitile. Niwananga wehi wako wose haulongozi wako. Nizaditenda zina jako kuwa kulu fana mazina ya wakulu ng'hani muna iisi yose. <verse eid="2SA 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 7:10" />Niye nizawasagulila wanhu wangu Waisilaili hanhu ha kukala, muladi wakale hanhu hawo wenyewo, sekewagazigwe kaidi. Wanhu wasede hawezawagaza kaidi fana viwawagazile baho ichanduso, <verse eid="2SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 7:11" />na fana viwatendile kwandusila lusita viniwekile wasemi wawatawale wanhu wangu Isilaili. Iviya nizakwing'ha tindiwalo kulawa kwa wehi wako wose na niye Mndewa Mulungu nizautenda welesi wako kuwa watawala. <verse eid="2SA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 7:12" />Siku zako vondazimale na vondaugone na wasaho zako, nizamsagula mwanago imwe yawe mfalume na nizaugangamiza ufalume wake. <verse eid="2SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 7:13" />Yeye niiyo yondayazenge kaye kwa zina jangu. Iviya ufalume wake nizaugangamiza siku zose. <verse eid="2SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 7:14" />Nizakuwa tati yake, nayo kezakuwa mwanangu. Yahatenda yehile nizamtagusa kwa balati dodisang'haniligwa na wanhu na nhaguso yondaigaligwe na wanhu. <verse eid="2SA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 7:15" />Mbali ulondo wangu wa kufunya umoyo hawizasegezigwa kumwake fana viya vinimsegezele Sauli muladi weye uwe mfalume. <verse eid="2SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 7:16" />Kaye yako na ufalume wako wizakala siku zose haulongozi wangu, iviya nizaugangamiza siku zose.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 7:17" />Nasani kamulongela Daudi mbuli zose za magubulo yayo yose.<verse eid="2SA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi kompula Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 7:18" />Maabaho mfalume Daudi kengila muna dihema na kakala haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu kalonga, “Niye yelihi, na welesi wangu welihi mbaka konigala hano hanili? <verse eid="2SA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 7:19" />Mbuli ino ikala ndodo kumwako mbaka kuwekila chilagano welesi wangu kwa miyaka ikwiza. Iviya weye Mndewa Mulungu kunitenda niwone mbuli izo. <verse eid="2SA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 7:20" />Na niye Daudi, nyongeze kulonga choni? Kwaviya kunimanya niye msang'hani wako, weye Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="2SA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 7:21" />Kwa ichimu cha lagano jako na kusondelela moyo wako, kutenda yano yose makulu muladi unifundize niye. <verse eid="2SA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 7:22" />Lola viya viwili mkulu, weye Mndewa Mulungu! Habule imwenga yalingile fana weye, weye Mulungu kwadumwe, fana viya vichihulike kwa magutwi yetu. <verse eid="2SA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 7:23" />Wanhu welihi walingile fana wanhu wako Waisilaili, waja weye Mulungu kuhita kuwakombola kuwa wanhu wako mwenyewo? Kuitendela zina jako mwenyewo na kutenda mbuli ng'hulu na mauzauza ya kudumbiza kwa kuwawinga wanhu na milungu ya zisi zimwenga kulawa haulongozi wa wanhu wako uwakombole kulawa Misili. <verse eid="2SA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 7:24" />Na kuwasagula wanhu wako Waisilaili kwa ichimu chako mwenyewo, muladi wadahe kuwa wanhu wako siku zose na weye Mndewa Mulungu kuwa Mulungu wawo.<verse eid="2SA 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 7:25" />“Lelo weye, Mndewa Mulungu, chifikize siku zose chiya chilagano chiulongile kusonhela niye msang'hani wako na welesi wangu na utende fana viulongile. <verse eid="2SA 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 7:26" />Zina jako dizakuwa kulu siku zose. Wanhu wezalonga, ‘Mndewa Mulungu Yeli na Udahi ni Mulungu wa Isilaili.’ Na kaye ya msang'hani wako niye Daudi izagendelela haulongozi wako. <verse eid="2SA 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 7:27" />Kwaviya weye, Mndewa Mulungu Wili na Udahi, Mulungu wa Isilaili kunigubulila niye msang'hani wako kulonga, ‘Nizautenda welesi wako kuwa watawala.’ Ivo niye nipata ugalu wa kukupula mbuli ino.<verse eid="2SA 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 7:28" />“Lelo weye, Mndewa Mulungu, weye kwa Mulungu na mbuli zako ni kweli, kumulaganila chinhu icho chinogile msang'hani wako. <verse eid="2SA 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 7:29" />Ivo nokupula uutemele mate welesi wangu niye msang'hani wako muladi wagendelele kutawala siku zose, kwaviya weye Mndewa Mulungu kulagana na kwizagendelela kunitemela mate niye na welesi wangu siku zose.”<verse eid="2SA 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kowahuma wehi wake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 8:1" />Vizifosile mbuli izo, Daudi kawatowa Wafilisiti na kawahuma. Daudi kadisola bululu da Mesige Amma kulawa muna yamakono ya Wafilisiti.<verse eid="2SA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 8:2" />Viyafosile yayo Daudi kawahuma Wamoabu. Kawalongela wagone hasi kwa msitali na kuwalinga kwa utali wa luzabi. Chila viyalingile utali wa luzabi uwo miyanza midi bumbila ijo dikomigwa. Viyalingile lweketatu bumbila ijo hadikomigwe bule. Wamoabu wakala watumwa wa Daudi na wamuliha kodi.<verse eid="2SA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 8:3" />Maabaho Daudi kamuhuma Hadadezeli, mwana wa Lehobu mfalume wa Soba, viyahitile kutawala kaidi hanhu ha lwanda lwa Efulate. <verse eid="2SA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 8:4" />Daudi kawahoka wakwelafalasi 1,700 na watowang'hondo wogenda kwa magulu 20,000. Maabaho Daudi kawakanha imige falasi waja wobulula matololi, mbali falasi gana dimwe kawasigaza.<verse eid="2SA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 8:5" />Baho Washami kulawa Damasiki viwezile kumtaza Hadadezeli mfalume wa Soba, Daudi kawakoma wanhu 22,000. <verse eid="2SA 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 8:6" />Maabaho Daudi kaweka watowang'hondo muna ufalume wa Washami uko Damasiki, Washami wawo wamsang'hanila Daudi na kumuliha kodi. Mndewa Mulungu kamtenda Daudi yahume chila hanhu hoyahitile.<verse eid="2SA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 8:7" />Baho Daudi kazisola ngao za zahabu ziwamhile watowang'hondo wa Hadadezeli na kazigala Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 8:8" />Iviya kasola shaba nyingi ng'hani kulawa na Beta na Belosai mabululu ya Hadadezeli.<verse eid="2SA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 8:9" />Mfalume Toyi wa Hamasi viyahulike kuwa Daudi kadihuma bumbila jose da watowang'hondo da Hadadezeli, <verse eid="2SA 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 8:10" />kamtuma Yolamu mwanage kwa mfalume Daudi kumulamsa na kumuhongeza kwaviya kakala kaitowa na Hadadezeli na kumuhuma, iviya Hadadezeli kaitowa na Toyi miyanza mingi. Yolamu kamgalila Daudi vitumetume va viya vovitendigwe kwa hela na zahabu na shaba. <verse eid="2SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 8:11" />Mfalume Daudi kavika hakwe viya vino kwa Mndewa Mulungu fana viya viyatendile kwa hela na zahabu kulawa muna izisi zose zoyazihumile. <verse eid="2SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 8:12" />Zisi izo ni Edomu na Moabu na Amoni na Filisiti na Amaleki, iviya keka hakwe vinhu viyahokile kulawa kwa Hadadezeli mwana wa Lehobu mfalume wa Soba.<verse eid="2SA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 8:13" />Daudi kamanyika ng'hani viyakalile kobwela viyamalile kuwakoma Waedomu 18,000 kuna Dibawe da Munyu.<verse eid="2SA 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 8:14" />Keka malago ya watowang'hondo muna iisi yose ya Edomu. Waedomu wose wa uko wawa wasang'hani wa Daudi. Mndewa Mulungu kamtenda Daudi yahume chila hanhu hoyahitile.<verse eid="2SA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakulu wamsang'hanile Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 8:15" />Daudi katawala Isilaili yose na katagusa voilondeka kwa wanhu wake wose. <verse eid="2SA 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 8:16" />Yoabu yelekigwe na mwanamke Seluya, kakala mkulu wa mabumbila ya watowang'hondo. Yehoshafati, mwana wa Ahiludi kakala mwikaji lukumbuso wa mfalume. <verse eid="2SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 8:17" />Sadoki, mwana wa Ahitubu na Ahimeleki, mwana wa Abiasali wakala wakulu wa nhambiko. Selaya kakala mwandikaji. <verse eid="2SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 8:18" />Benaya, mwana wa Yehoyada kakala mulangulizi wa Wakelesi na Wapelesi. Na wana wa Daudi wakala wakulu wa nhambiko.<verse eid="2SA 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2SA 9" />
  <para style="s">Daudi komuwonela ubazi Mefiboshesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 9:1" />Daudi kauza, “Vino hasigale hata munhu imwe muna ikaye ya Sauli? One kauko, nolonda kumulagusa ulondo wa kufunya umoyo kwa ichimu cha Yonasani.”<verse eid="2SA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 9:2" />Kukala na msang'hani imwe wa kaye ya Sauli yoyatangigwe Siba. Siba katangigwa kuhita kwa Daudi. Mfalume kamuuza, “Weye niiyo Siba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:2">Nayo kamwidika, “Ona, niye ni msang'hani wako.”<verse eid="2SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 9:3" />Mfalume kauza, “Vino hasigale hata munhu imwe muna ikaye ya Sauli muladi nidahe kumulagusa ulondo wa kufunya umoyo fana vinimulaganile Mulungu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:3">Siba kamwidika mfalume, “Kauko mwana wa Yonasani kasigala, mbali mbetembete.”<verse eid="2SA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 9:4" />Mfalume kamuuza, “Iyo kakulihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:4">Siba kamwidika, “Kauko kuna ikaye ya Makili mwana wa Amieli uko Lodebali.” <verse eid="2SA 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 9:5" />Ivo mfalume Daudi katuma wanhu wamgale kulawa Lodebali muna ikaye ya Makili mwana wa Amieli.<verse eid="2SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 9:6" />Ivo Mefiboshesi mwana wa Yonasani na mzukulu wa Sauli kafika. Viyafikile kwa Daudi katumbala mavindi mbaka chihanga chidalisa hasi na kumwing'ha mfalume hishima.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">Daudi kamtanga, “Mefiboshesi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:6">Mefiboshesi kamwidika, “Niiyo niye, msang'hani wako.”<verse eid="2SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 9:7" />Daudi kamulongela, “Sekeudumbe, nizakulagusa ulondo wa kufunya umoyo kwa ichimu cha tati yako Yonasani. Mgunda wose ukalile wa wasaho yako Sauli nizakubwelezela na kwizakuja ndiya hana imeza yangu siku zose.”<verse eid="2SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 9:8" />Mefiboshesi katumbala mavindi kalonga, “Mwenevale, vino habali kuwona vinoga kumwangu? Niye siyo chinhu kufosa imbwa yafile.”<verse eid="2SA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 9:9" />Maabaho mfalume kamtanga Siba, msang'hani wa Sauli, kamulongela, “Nimwing'ha Mefiboshesi, mzukulu wa mwenevale wako Sauli chila chinhu chochikalile cha Sauli na welesi wake. <verse eid="2SA 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 9:10" />Weye na wanago na wasang'hani wako mwizamulimila Mefiboshesi. Mwizamgalila mavuno mzukulu wa mwenevale wako kuwa ndiya yake. Mbali yeye kezakuja ndiya haimeza yangu.” Lusita ulo Siba kakala na wana wa chilume longo na watano na wasang'hani malongo maidi.<verse eid="2SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 9:11" />Maabaho Siba kamwidika mfalume, “Nizatenda chila chinhu kwa kusondelela ndagilizi yako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 9:11">Ivo Mefiboshesi kakala koja ndiya yake kuna imeza ya Daudi, fana imwe wa wana wa mfalume. <verse eid="2SA 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 9:12" />Iviya Mefiboshesi kakala na mwana mdodo wa chilume yatangigwe Mika. Wanhu wose wa kaye ya Siba wakala wasang'hani wa Mefiboshesi. <verse eid="2SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 9:13" />Ivo Mefiboshesi yakalile mbetembete kakala uko Yelusalemu na chila siku kakala yoja ndiya mwiimeza ya mfalume.<verse eid="2SA 9:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2SA 10" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kowahuma Waamoni na Washami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 10:1" />Vizifosile mbuli izo, mfalume Nahasi wa Waamoni kadanganika na mwanage yoyatangigwe Hanuni kawa mfalume. <verse eid="2SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 10:2" />Mfalume Daudi kalonga, “Nizamulagusa ulondo wa kufunya umoyo Hanuni mwana wa Nahashi fana viya viyanitendele tati yake.” Ivo Daudi katuma wasenga kumuliza Hanuni kusonhela tati yake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:2">Wasenga wa Daudi viwafikile muna iisi ya Waamoni, <verse eid="2SA 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 10:3" />wakulu wa Waamoni wamulongela Hanuni mwenevale wawo, “Kogesa kuwa Daudi kamuhishimu tati yako kwa kuchigalila wanhu wakulize? Vino Daudi hawatumile wanhu wano bule kumwako muladi kudipekula na kudipelemba bululu na kudinanga?”<verse eid="2SA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 10:4" />Ivo Hanuni kawasola wasenga wawo wa Daudi, kawawegula chila imwe banzi ya ndevu zake, kayadeka mawalo yawo hagati mbaka muna yamadako, maabaho kawalekelela wahite. <verse eid="2SA 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 10:5" />Daudi viyalongeligwe mbuli ino kawatuma wasenga kuhita kuwahokela, kwaviya wakala wagumigwa chinyala. Mfalume kalonga, “Kaleni uko Yeliko mbaka ndevu zenu vondazote, maabaho mubwele ukaye.”<verse eid="2SA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 10:6" />Waamoni viwawonile kuwa wamguma ludoko Daudi, wagoneka watowang'hondo wogenda na migulu Washami 20,000 kulawa Besi Lehobu na Soba, iviya mfalume wa Maaka hamwe na watowang'hondo 1,000 na iviya watowang'hondo 12,000 kulawa Tobu. <verse eid="2SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 10:7" />Daudi kahulika mbuli izo na kamtuma Yoabu hamwe na magalu wose wa watowang'hondo. <verse eid="2SA 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 10:8" />Waamoni walawa na waipanga kwa ng'hondo hana ulwivi mkulu wa bululu jawo na Washami wa Soba na Lehobu na wanhu kulawa Tobu na Maaka wakala waidumwe kuichuwala.<verse eid="2SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 10:9" />Yoabu viyawone kuja kuwa waipanga misitali kuulongozi wake na kuchisogo, kabagula wamwenga wa watowang'hondo magalu ng'hani wa Isilaili, kawapanga kuitowa na Washami. <verse eid="2SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 10:10" />Wasigale kaweka hasi ya ulolesi wa ndugu yake Abishai, nayo kawalagiliza waitowe na Waamoni. <verse eid="2SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 10:11" />Yoabu kamulongela Abishai, “One nahawona Washami wana nguvu kufosa niye kwizanitaza. Na one Waamoni wana nguvu kufosa weye nizakwiza kukutaza. <verse eid="2SA 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 10:12" />Mbali igangamize chiitowe chilume kwa ichimu cha wanhu wetu na kwa ichimu cha mabululu ya Mulungu wetu. Mndewa Mulungu kezatenda chiya chinogile kumwake.”<verse eid="2SA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 10:13" />Baho Yoabu na wanhu wake wakwenhukila kwiitowa na Washami na Washami wakimbila. <verse eid="2SA 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 10:14" />Waamoni viwawone kuwa Washami wakimbila, nawo wamkimbila Abishai na kwingila kudibululu. Baho Yoabu kabwela kulawa kuna ing'hondo na Waamoni na kufika Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 10:15" />Mbali Washami viwawone wahumigwa na Waisilaili, waiduganya mabumbila hamwe. <verse eid="2SA 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 10:16" />Mfalume Hadadezeli kalagiliza Washami wose wokalile umwambu wa lwanda lwa Efulate, wahite bululu da Helamu. Shobaki, mkulu wa watowang'hondo wa Hadadezeli, kawalanguliza. <verse eid="2SA 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 10:17" />Daudi viyalongeligwe mbuli izo, kawaduganya hamwe Waisilaili wose, waloka lwanda lwa Yoludani na kuhita mbaka Helamu. Washami wapanga mabumbila yawo ya ng'hondo na kuitowa nayo Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 10:18" />Mbali Waisilaili wawawinga Washami. Daudi na watowang'hondo wake wawakoma wanhu 700 wa mituka ya kubululigwa na falasi na wakwelafalasi 40,000. Iviya kamtowa Shobaki mkulu wawo watowang'hondo, nayo kadanganikila uko. <verse eid="2SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 10:19" />Baho wafalume wose wamsang'hanile Hadadezeli viwawone wahumigwa na Waisilaili, wailumba na Daudi kwa tindiwalo na watogola kutawaligwa nayo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 10:19">Ivo Washami wadumba kuwataza Waamoni kaidi.<verse eid="2SA 10:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Daudi na Besisheba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 11:1" />Chila mwanduso wa mwaka wa sambi wafalume wahitaga kuna ing'hondo, Daudi kamtuma Yoabu na wasang'hani wake hamwe na watowang'hondo wa Waisilaili kwiitowa. Nawo wawananga Waamoni na kuzinga bululu da Laba muladi wakaya watogole kuhumwa. Mbali Daudi mwenyewo kasigala Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 11:2" />Siku dimwe lusita lwa ichigulogulo, Daudi kalamuka kulawa muna zinhongo na kahita uchanyha ya chisuwili chibadagale cha kaye yake. Viyakalile kogenda uko, kawona muke imwe kokoga, na iyo kakala lumondo ng'hani. <verse eid="2SA 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 11:3" />Daudi katuma msenga kuuza mbuli ya muke iyo. Msenga iyo kamulongela Daudi, “Muke iyo kotangigwa Besisheba mwana wa Eliamu yeli muke wa Uliya Muhiti.” <verse eid="2SA 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 11:4" />Daudi katuma wasenga wamgale Besisheba. Ivo Besisheba keza kwa Daudi nayo kambandama. Lusita ulo kakala kamala kuisafya kulawa muna zisiku zake. Maabaho kabwela ukaye yake. <verse eid="2SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 11:5" />Mwanamke iyo kapata wimo na kamgalila usenga Daudi, kamulongela “Niye nina wimo.”<verse eid="2SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 11:6" />Ivo Daudi katuma usenga kwa Yoabu, “Mbweleze Uliya Muhiti kumwangu.” Yoabu kamtuma Ulia kwa Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 11:7" />Uliya viyafikile, Daudi kamuuza mbuli ya Yoabu na mbuli ya watowang'hondo na ng'hondo viigendelela. <verse eid="2SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 11:8" />Maabaho Daudi kamulongela Uliya, “Hita ukaye yako na unawe migulu.” Uliya viyasegele haikaye ya mfalume, Daudi kamtumila chitumetume ukaye yake. <verse eid="2SA 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 11:9" />Mbali Uliya hahitile, kagona hamwe na wasang'hani habehi na ulwivi lwa kaye ya mfalume. <verse eid="2SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 11:10" />Daudi viyalongeligwe kuwa Uliya hahitile ukaye yake, Daudi kamuuza Uliya, “Weye kulawa mwanza, vino habali huhitile ukaye yako?”<verse eid="2SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 11:11" />Ulia kamwidika Daudi, “Sanduku da lagano hamwe na watowang'hondo wa Isilaili na Yuda wokala muna yamahema kuna ing'hondo. Mwenevale wangu Yoabu na wasang'hani wake wose weka lago jawo kuchuwala, ivo yodahikaze niye nihite ukaye nikaje na kung'wa na kugona na muke wangu? Ukweli fana viukala, sizatenda chinhu fanile icho bule.” <verse eid="2SA 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 11:12" />Maabaho Daudi kamulongela Uliya, “Lelo sigala hano diyelo iviya na igolo nizakuleka ubwele kwa watowang'hondo.” Ivo Uliya kasigala kudibululu da Yelusalemu siku ija na igolo yake. <verse eid="2SA 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 11:13" />Daudi kamgoneka Uliya kuja na kung'wa hamwe nayo. Nayo Daudi kamtenda yakolwe. Mbali ichigulogulo Uliya hahitile ukaye, ila kahita kugona muna dilili jake hamwe na wasang'hani wa mwenevale wake.<verse eid="2SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 11:14" />Imitondo yake Daudi kamwandikila usenga Yoabu na kamtuma Uliya yaugale. <verse eid="2SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 11:15" />Muna usenga kandika vino, “Mwike Uliya kuulongozi kuna ing'hondo ng'hulu ng'hani, maabaho muleke uko na ubwele kuchisogo muladi yatowigwe mbaka yadanganike.” <verse eid="2SA 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 11:16" />Baho Yoabu viyakalile kadizunguluka bululu, kamwika Uliya hanhu baho kavimanya kuwa watowang'hondo wa wehi wakala magalu. <verse eid="2SA 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 11:17" />Wanhu wa bululu ijo viwezile kuitowa na Yoabu, watowang'hondo wamwenga wa Daudi wadanganika na Uliya Muhiti iviya kadanganika.<verse eid="2SA 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 11:18" />Maabaho Yoabu katuma usenga kwa Daudi kumulongela mbuli zose za ng'hondo, <verse eid="2SA 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 11:19" />na kamulagiliza imsenga, “Wahakomeleza kumulongela mfalume kusonhela mbuli zose za ng'hondo, <verse eid="2SA 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 11:20" />mfalume kodaha kuwona ludoko na kukuuza, ‘Habali mukwenhukila habehi na ng'huta za bululu vimukalile moitowa? Hamvimanyile bule wezadaha kuwatowa misale kulawa kuna zinhumba izo? <verse eid="2SA 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 11:21" />Vino hamkumbuka viya viyadanganike Abimeleki mwana wa Yelubeshesi? Mwanamke kampigisila dibwe da kudundila kulawa hana ing'huta na Abimeleki kadanganika uko Sebesi. Habali mukwenhuka habehi na ing'huta?’ One yahakuuza ivo, mulongele, ‘Iviya msang'hani wako Ulia Muhiti kadanganika.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 11:22" />Ivo msenga kasegela, viyafikile kamulongela Daudi mbuli zose ziyatumigwe na Yoabu yazilonge. <verse eid="2SA 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 11:23" />Msenga kamulongela Daudi, “Wehi wetu wachihuma. Walawa kunze ya bululu na kuchitowa mwiichuwala, mbali cheye chiwabweleza mbaka kuulwivi lukulu lwa bululu. <verse eid="2SA 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 11:24" />Maabaho wachitowa misale cheye, wasang'hani wako, kulawa kwiinhumba. Watowang'hondo wamwenga wadanganika. Iviya msang'hani wako, Ulia Muhiti, kadanganika.”<verse eid="2SA 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 11:25" />Daudi kamulongela msenga ija, “Mulongele vino Yoabu, ‘Mbuli ino sekeikugalile lugano kwaviya panga dabule meso. Ng'hondo yokoma munhu yoyose. Iyohe kuditowa bululu na udinange.’ Mulongele ivo Yoabu muladi kumguma moyo.”<verse eid="2SA 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 11:26" />Besisheba muke wa Ulia viyahulike kuwa mulumake kadanganika, kamulilila. <verse eid="2SA 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 11:27" />Ndilo iyo viimalile, Daudi kalagiliza kuwa muke iyo yagaligwe kuna ikaye ya mfalume. Nayo kawa muke wake na kamwelekela mwana wa chilume. Mbali mbuli iyatendile Daudi imwihila Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="2SA 11:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2SA 12" />
  <para style="s">Nasani komkalikila Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 12:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kamtuma Nasani kwa Daudi. Viyafikile kumwake kamulongela, “Kukala na wanhu waidi wowakalile muna dibululu dimwe. Imwe kakala na vinhu vingi na imwenga kakala ngayengaye. <verse eid="2SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 12:2" />Ija yeli na vinhu vingi kakala na ng'hondolo wengi na ng'ombe wengi, <verse eid="2SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 12:3" />mbali ija ngayengaye kakala kabule chinhu ila ng'hondolo mdodo zike niiyo yoyakalile kamgula. Kamwika goya ng'hondolo iyo na kakulila kumwake na wanage. Ng'hondolo iyo kaja hamwe na mwenevale wake na kung'hwila nhungo yake, iviya ng'hondolo iyo kagona muna imhambaga mwa mwenevale wake. Kumwake kawa fana mwanage. <verse eid="2SA 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 12:4" />Siku dimwe munhu yeli na vinhu vingi keziligwa na nyambenyambe. Munhu yeli na vinhu vingi halondile bule kumchinjila imwe wa ng'hondolo zake mwenyewo hebu ng'ombe wake muladi yamsasalile ija nyambenyambe, mbali kamuhoka ngayengaye ng'hondolo wake na kumsasalila nyambenyambe ija.”<verse eid="2SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 12:5" />Maabaho Daudi viyahulike ivo, kamuwonela ludoko munhu ija yeli na vinhu vingi. Kamulongela Nasani, “Noilaha kwa Mndewa Mulungu yeli mgima, munhu yatendile mbuli iyo kolondeka kudanganika! <verse eid="2SA 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 12:6" />Kolondeka yamulihe ija ngayengaye mwanang'hondolo iyo miyanza mine, kwaviya katenda mbuli ihile na hakalile na ubazi.”<verse eid="2SA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 12:7" />Nasani kamulongela Daudi, “Weye niiyo munhu ija. Lelo Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili kolonga vino, ‘Nikuhaka mavuta uwe mfalume wa Isilaili na nikulopola kulawa mmikono ya Sauli. <verse eid="2SA 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 12:8" />Nikwing'ha wanhu wa kaye ya mwenevale wako na wake wa mwenevale wako wawe wako. Nikwing'ha wanhu wa Isilaili na Yuda. Mbuli zino zose zahawile ndodo nahakongezele. <verse eid="2SA 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 12:9" />Habali kuzizeha mbuli zangu na kutenda mbuli zihile haulongozi hangu? Kumulungila Uliya Muhiti yakomigwe na panga da Waamoni na kweli kakomigwa na Waamoni, maabaho kumsola muke wake yawe muke wako. <verse eid="2SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 12:10" />Lelo panga hadizasegela muna ikaye yako, kwaviya kunizeha na kumsola muke wa Ulia Muhiti yawe muke wako.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 12:11" />Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, ‘Lola nizagala manhesa muna uwelesi wako mwenyewo. Nizawasola wake zako na kumwing'ha mkaya miyago kuno weye kolola. Nayo kezagona nawo chila munhu kolola. <verse eid="2SA 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 12:12" />Weye kutenda mbuli iyo kwa chifiso, mbali niye nizatenda mbuli iyo Waisilaili wose wolola.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 12:13" />Daudi kamulongela Nasani, “Nimuhasanya Mndewa Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:13">Nasani kamwidika, “Mndewa Mulungu kakulekelela uhasanyi wako, hwizadanganika bule. <verse eid="2SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 12:14" />Mbali kwa mbuli ino kumzeha Mndewa Mulungu, ivo mwana yondayelekigwe kezadanganika.” <verse eid="2SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 12:15" />Maabaho Nasani kabwela ukaye yake.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 12:15">Mwanage Daudi kodanganika</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:15">Mndewa Mulungu kamwing'ha utamu mwana wa Besisheba, mkefilwa wa Ulia yoyamwelekele Daudi, nayo kawa mtamu ng'hani. <verse eid="2SA 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 12:16" />Daudi kampula Mulungu muladi mwanage yahone. Hadile chinhu chochose na kengila muna ichiheleto chake na kagona hasi ichilo chose. <verse eid="2SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 12:17" />Walala wowakalile muna ikaye yake wamwimila hamgwazo na kumwinula kulawa hasi, mbali kalema na hadile ndiya yoyose. <verse eid="2SA 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 12:18" />Siku yesaba imwana kadanganika na wasang'hani wa Daudi wadumba kumulongela kuwa mwana kadanganika. Kwaviya walonga, “Mwana viyakalile mgima, vichilongile nayo Daudi hachitegeleze. Vino yodahikaze kumulongela mwana kadanganika? Kodaha kuilumiza!”<verse eid="2SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 12:19" />Daudi viyawawone wasang'hani wake woinyong'onyela, kavimanya kuwa mwanage kadanganika. Ivo kawauza, “Mwana kadanganika?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 12:19">Wamwidika, “Ona kadanganika.”<verse eid="2SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 12:20" />Baho Daudi kenuka hasi, koga na kaiboboda mavuta na kwasakanya viwalo vake. Kahita mwiidihema da Mndewa Mulungu na katosa umo. Maabaho kabwela ukaye yake na viyapulile ndiya wamsasalila kaja.<verse eid="2SA 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 12:21" />Wasang'hani wake wamuuza, “Mbuli yaki ino youtendile? Mwana viyakalile mgima kuleka kuja na kukala ulila, mbali mwana viyadanganike, kwinuka kuja ndiya.”<verse eid="2SA 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 12:22" />Daudi kawedika, “Mwana viyakalile mgima, nileka kuja na nikala nolila. Ivo nigesa, ‘Yelihi yovimanya? Yodahika Mndewa Mulungu kezaniwonela ubazi na kezamuhonya imwana.’ <verse eid="2SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 12:23" />Mbali lelo kadanganika, habali nileke kuja? Vino niye nodaha kumbweleza kaidi imwana yawe mgima? Nizahita kumwake, mbali yeye hadaha kubwela kumwangu.”<verse eid="2SA 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solomoni kokwelekwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 12:24" />Daudi kamguma moyo Besisheba muke wake. Kahita kumbandama na kapata wimo na kuibasula mwana wa chilume, nayo katangigwa Solomoni. Mndewa Mulungu kamulonda imwana, <verse eid="2SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 12:25" />ivo kamtuma mulotezi Nasani kumwing'ha imwana zina Yedidia, fambulo jake Mndewa Mulungu komulonda.<verse eid="2SA 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waamoni wonangigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 12:26" />Lusita ulo Yoabu kagendelela kuitowa na bululu da Laba da Waamoni na kaisola mhongono ya chifalume. <verse eid="2SA 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 12:27" />Yoabu katuma wasenga kwa Daudi kulonga, “Niitowa ng'hondo na bululu da Laba na nidisola sima jawo. <verse eid="2SA 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 12:28" />Lelo waduganye wanhu wose wowasigale, udizunguluke bululu na kudisola. Buleivo nizadisola na dizatangigwa kwa zina jangu.” <verse eid="2SA 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 12:29" />Ivo Daudi kawaduganya wanhu wose kahita Laba. Kaditowa na kudisola bululu ijo. <verse eid="2SA 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 12:30" />Maabaho kasola kombelo da mfalume wawo mditwi jake. Kombelo dikala na nzamo ya chilo malongo matatu na tano, dihambigwa kwa dibwe da bei ng'hulu. Nayo Daudi kavazigwa kombelo ijo mditwi jake. Maabaho yeye na watowang'hondo wake wasola vinhu vingi ng'hani va bei ng'hulu muna dibululu ijo. <verse eid="2SA 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 12:31" />Kaweka wanhu wa bululu ijo wasang'hanile usang'hano kwa kusang'hanila misumeno na sululu na nhemo nayo kaweka muna isang'hano ya kusoma matafali. Katenda ivo muna yamabululu yose ya Waamoni, maabaho Daudi na wanhu wake wose wabwela Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2SA 13" />
  <para style="s">Aminoni na Tamali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 13:1" />Vizifosile mbuli izo, Abisalomu, mwana wa Daudi kakala na lumbu lumondo yatangigwe Tamali. Nayo Aminoni, mwana wa Daudi kamulonda.<verse eid="2SA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 13:2" />Tamali kakala mhambe na kwa ichimu cha wakalizi wake, Aminoni hadahile kumtendela chochose. Mbali Aminoni kanogelwa ng'hani na Tamali mbaka kawa mtamu. <verse eid="2SA 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 13:3" />Mbali Aminoni kakala na mbwiyake yatangigwe Yonadabu, mwana wa Shama ndugu wa Daudi. Yonadabu kakala mbala ng'hani. <verse eid="2SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 13:4" />Yonadabu kamulongela Aminoni, “Weye kwa mwana wa mfalume, habali kosoka na kowoneka husangalala chila siku? Vino habali hulonda kunilongela?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:4">Aminoni kamwidika, “Nomulonda Tamali, lumbu jake Abisalomu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">lumbu jake Abisalomu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tamali na Abisalomu wakala mama imwe tata imwe.</char></note> ndugu yangu.”<verse eid="2SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 13:5" />Yonadabu kamulongela, “Itende kuwa kwa mtamu na tambalala mudikomwa. Tati yako yaheza kukulaula, mulongele, ‘Mulekele Tamali lumbu jangu yeze yanigalile ndiya nije. Nolamba mulekelele yeze kunisasalila ndiya haulongozi wangu, muladi yanyang'hize.’ ” <verse eid="2SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 13:6" />Aminoni kaitenda fana mtamu na katambalala muna dikomwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:6">Mfalume Daudi kahita kumulaula na Aminoni kamulongela, “Nolamba Tamali yeze yanisasalile magate chidogo kuno nomulola. Maabaho yeye mwenyewo yanilise.”<verse eid="2SA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 13:7" />Ivo Daudi kamtuma msenga yamulongele Tamali kuna imhong'hono, “Hita kwiikaye ya lumbu jako Aminoni ukamsasalile ndiya.” <verse eid="2SA 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 13:8" />Tamali kahita kuna ikaye ya Aminoni, lumbu jake. Kamfika katambalala hasi. Kasola usage kabuluga kwa makono na kamsasalila magate kuno Aminoni komulola. Maabaho kayambika. <verse eid="2SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 13:9" />Tamali kasola chikalango na kamkwenhukila Aminoni haulongozi wake mbali kalema kuja. Nayo Aminoni kalonga, “Mweye mose laweni kunze.” Baho wanhu wose walawa. <verse eid="2SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 13:10" />Maabaho Aminoni kamulongela Tamali, “Nigalile magate yayo muchiheleto changu na unyang'hize.” Tamali kasola yamagate yoyatendile na kuyagala muna ichiheleto cha Aminoni, lumbu jake. <verse eid="2SA 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 13:11" />Mbali viyakalile yomgalila magate lumbu jake muladi yaje, Aminoni kamgwila Tamali na kamulongela, “Izo ugone na niye lumbu jangu.”<verse eid="2SA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 13:12" />Tamali kamwidika, “Siivo bule lumbu jangu, sekeuniwangilize. Mbuli ino hailondeka kutendeka muna iisi ya Isilaili! Sekeutende mbuli ino ya mdukula. <verse eid="2SA 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 13:13" />Niye sidaha bule kufunyila umoyo chinyala icho. Na kwa ubanzi wako kwizakuwa imwe wa wabozi wa Isilaili. Lelo niye nokulamba ulonge na mfalume kwaviya hezalema unisole.” <verse eid="2SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 13:14" />Mbali Aminoni hatogole kumtegeleza Tamali na kwaviya kakala na nguvu kumfosa Tamali, kambandama kwa nguvu.<verse eid="2SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 13:15" />Haichanduso Aminoni kakala komulonda ng'hani mbali lelo kamwihila ng'hani kufosa viya viyamulondile. Kamulongela Tamali, “Inuka ulawe kunze!”<verse eid="2SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 13:16" />Tamali kamwidika “Siivo bule, wihi uno wa kuniwinga wiha ng'hani kufosa uja wounitendele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:16">Mbali Aminoni halondile kumtegeleza. <verse eid="2SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 13:17" />Kamtanga mbwanga yomsang'hanila na kamulongela, “Msegeze muke ino haulongozi wangu! Mulave kunze na hinda ulwivi!” <verse eid="2SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 13:18" />Maabaho msang'hani kamulava kunze na kahinda ulwivi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:18">Tamali kakala yayawale walo tali dili na makono matali, kwaviya niivo viwayawale wandele wa mfalume wakalile mhambe lusita ulo. <verse eid="2SA 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 13:19" />Tamali kaihaka maivu mditwi kadidega walo jake na kageleka yamakono mditwi, maabaho kasegela kuno kolila kwa dizi kulu. <verse eid="2SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 13:20" />Abisalomu lumbu jake kamulongela, “Vino Aminoni lumbu jako kagona na weye? Nyamala mwali wangu kwaviya iyo ni lumbu jako. Sekewiike mbuli iyo muumoyo wako.” Ivo Tamali kakala muna ikaye ya Abisalomu, lumbu jake kuno kana lugano na kadumwe.<verse eid="2SA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 13:21" />Mfalume Daudi viyahulike mbuli izo zose, kengilwa na ludoko. <verse eid="2SA 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 13:22" />Abisalomu kamwihila ng'hani Aminoni mbaka halongile nayo dinogile hebu dihile, kwaviya kamguma chinyala lumbu jake Tamali.<verse eid="2SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abisalomu komkoma Aminoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 13:23" />Miyaka midi hamwande, Abisalomu kakala na wasang'hani wa kukanha mazoya ya ng'hondolo uko Baali Hazoli ili ubanzi wa Efulaimu. Nayo Abisalomu kawagoneka wana wa chilume wose wa mfalume.<verse eid="2SA 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 13:24" />Abisalomu kamuhitila mfalume na kumulongela, “Lola niye ninawo wakanha mazoya ng'hondolo. Nokulamba weye mfalume hamwe na wasang'hani wako, muhite hamwe na niye.”<verse eid="2SA 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 13:25" />Mfalume kamwidika, “Siivo bule mwanangu. Sekechihite chose, sekechiwe mbahasha kumwako.” Mbali Abisalomu kamulamba ng'hani tati yake yahite. Mfalume kalema, mbali kamtemela mate.<verse eid="2SA 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 13:26" />Maabaho Abisalomu kamulongela, “One huhita, lelo mulekelele ndugu yangu Aminoni chihite nayo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 13:26">Mfalume kauza, “Habali yahite na mweye?” <verse eid="2SA 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 13:27" />Mbali Abisalomu kagendelela kumulamba mbaka mfalume kamulongela Aminoni na wanage wamwenga wahite hamwe nayo. Abisalomu kasasala dugila difaya da chifalume.<verse eid="2SA 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 13:28" />Abisalomu kawalongela wasang'hani wake, “Muloleni Aminoni vondayang'we divai na kudeng'helela. Vondanimulongeleni, ‘Mumtowe Aminoni,’ mumkome. Sekemumdumbe, yayo niyayo malagilizo kumwenu. Mugangamale na muwe magalu.” <verse eid="2SA 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 13:29" />Wasang'hani wa Abisalomu wamtendela Aminoni fana viwalagilizigwe na Abisalomu. Maabaho wana wa chilume wa mfalume wasegela. Chila imwe wawo kakwela mnyama wake yalingile fana chihongwe na kukimbila. <verse eid="2SA 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 13:30" />Viwakalile wang'hali mzila Daudi kapata usenga kuwa Abisalomu kawakoma wana wose wa chilume wa mfalume na habule hata imwe wawo yoyasigale. <verse eid="2SA 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 13:31" />Mfalume Daudi kenuka na kayadega mawalo yake kwa usungu, kagona hasi. Iviya wasang'hani wake wose wowakalile wema habehi nayo wayadega mawalo yawo. <verse eid="2SA 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 13:32" />Mbali Yonadabu, mwana wa Shama, ndugu yake Daudi kamulongela, “Mwenevale sekeugese wanago wose wakomigwa. Aminoni muhala niiyo yakomigwe, mbali Abisalomu kailunga kutenda mbuli iyo kwandusila lusita luja Aminoni viyamgumile chinyala lumbu jake Tamali. <verse eid="2SA 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 13:33" />Ivo mwenevale wangu, mfalume, sekeugese muumoyo wako kuwa wanago wose wa chilume wadanganika. Aminoni muhala niiyo yadanganike.”<verse eid="2SA 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 13:34" />Mbali Abisalomu kakala kamala kukimbila. Mbwanga ija yakalile na zamu ya ukalizi kawona bumbila kulu da wanhu wokwiza ubanzi wa mulima kuna inzila ilawile Holonaimu. <verse eid="2SA 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 13:35" />Yonadabu kamulongela Daudi, “Waja wanago wokwiza, fana viya vinikulongele.” <verse eid="2SA 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 13:36" />Lusita luja msang'hani viyakomeleze kulonga, wana wa chilume wa mfalume wengila na wandusa kulila ng'hani. Iviya Daudi na wasang'hani wake walila kwa usungu.<verse eid="2SA 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 13:37" />Mbali Abisalomu kakimbila kahita kwa Talimai mwana wa Amihudi yeli mfalume wa Geshuli. Mfalume Daudi kamulilila mwanage siku nyingi. <verse eid="2SA 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 13:38" />Abisalomu kakimbilila Geshuli na kakala uko kwa lusita lwa miyaka mitatu. <verse eid="2SA 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 13:39" />Mfalume kalonda kulawa kumuhitila Abisalomu kwaviya ndilo ya Aminoni ikala imalile.<verse eid="2SA 13:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2SA 14" />
  <para style="s">Abisalomu kobwela Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 14:1" />Yoabu mwana wa Seluya kavimanya kuwa mfalume kakala yogesa ng'hani kumuwona Abisalomu. <verse eid="2SA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 14:2" />Ivo Yoabu katuma wanhu uko Tekoa wamulondele mwanamke yeli na ubala. Lusita viyafikile kamulongela, “Itende fana kwa muindilo na sekeuibobode mavuta mbali uvale mawalo ya ndilo. Lelo uitende fana mwanamke yeli muindilo kwa lusita lutali. <verse eid="2SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 14:3" />Maabaho hita kwa mfalume ukamulongele mbuli zonikulongele.” Maabaho Yoabu kamulongela mwanamke mbuli ya kulonga.<verse eid="2SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 14:4" />Mwanamke kulawa Tekoa kamuhitila mfalume na kumtumbala mavindi mbaka chihanga chidalisa hasi kwa hishima na kalonga, “Weye mfalume, nitaze!”<verse eid="2SA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 14:5" />Mfalume kamuuza “Kogazigwa na choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:5">Nayo kamwidika, “Kweli namgane. Mulumangu kadanganika. <verse eid="2SA 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 14:6" />Mwenevale, nikala na wana wa chilume waidi, siku dimwe viwakalile kumgunda wandusa kuitowa. Kwaviya hakuwile na munhu yoyose wa kuwalamula, imwe kamtowa miyage na kamkoma. <verse eid="2SA 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 14:7" />Lelo ndugu zangu wose wanihinduka. Wolonda nimulave kumwawo mwana iyamkomile miyage wadahe kumkoma kwa kuliha ugima wa ndugu yake. Mbali wolonda kumkoma muladi wasole uhazi wake. Lelo wahatenda ivo wezasegeza huwilo jangu dodisigale na zina da mulumangu na lukolo lwake lwizakwaga muna iisi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 14:8" />Mfalume kamulongela mwanamke ija, “Bwela ukaye yako. Niye nizailola goya mbuli yako.”<verse eid="2SA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 14:9" />Mwanamke ija kulawa Tekoa kamulongela, “Mwenevale wangu, ubananzi wose ukale kumwangu na muna uwelesi wangu. Mbali weye na ufalume wako sekemuwe na ubananzi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 14:10" />Mfalume kamwidika, “One munhu yoyose yahakulonga mbuli yoyose, mgale kumwangu na hezabwelela kukugaza kaidi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 14:11" />Mwanamke kamulongela, “Nokulamba mfalume nipulile kwa Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako, muladi ndugu yangu yolihiza chisasi cha ukomaji wa mwanangu sekeyongeze ubananzi umwenga wa kumkoma mwanangu ija imwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:11">Mfalume Daudi kamulaganila, “Noilaha fana Mndewa Mulungu voyokala, habule hata lunyele lumwe lwa mwanago londalulagale.”<verse eid="2SA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 14:12" />Mwanamke ija kamulongela, “Nokulamba mwenevale wangu, unilekelele nilonge mbuli imwe muhala kumwako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:12">Nayo kamwidika, “Haya longa.”<verse eid="2SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 14:13" />Mwanamke kamulongela, “Habali kuilunga kutenda mbuli zino kwa wanhu wa Mulungu? Kwa ichimu cha ulamuzi wako muna imbuli ino weye mwenyewo kuitagusa kuwa mbananzi, kwaviya humbweleze ija yawingigwe. <verse eid="2SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 14:14" />Cheye chizadanganika. Cheye chilinga fana mazi viyokwitika hasi, hayadahika kuzoleka kaidi. Mbali Mulungu hasegeza ugima wetu, yeye kotenda nzila muladi ija yawingigwe yadahe kubwela. <verse eid="2SA 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 14:15" />Niye niza kulonga na weye mwenevale wangu mfalume kwaviya wanhu wanitenda niwe na ludumbo. Nigesa, ‘Nizalonga na mfalume yahadahika kezanitendela niye msang'hani wake chonipula. <verse eid="2SA 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 14:16" />Kwaviya mfalume kezanihulika na kuchilopola niye na mwanangu kulawa muna yamakono ya wanhu walondile kuchikoma na kuchisegeza muna uhazi woyaching'hile Mulungu.’ <verse eid="2SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 14:17" />Ivo niye nilonga, ‘Mbuli ya mwenevale wangu mfalume inigalile tindiwalo, kwaviya mwenevale wangu mfalume kalinga fana msenga wa kuulanga wa Mulungu, yofambula yanogile na yehile. Mndewa Mulungu yawe hamwe na weye.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 14:18" />Mfalume kamulongela mwanamke ija, “Nizakuuza mbuli, weye kolondeka sekeunifise ukweli.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:18">Mwanamke ija kamwidika, “Niuze mbuli yoyose mwenevale wangu.”<verse eid="2SA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 14:19" />Daudi kamuuza, “Vino Yoabu kakutuma kumwangu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 14:19">Mwanamke ija kamwidika, “Mwenevale wangu, noilaha kwa ugima wako kuwa habule munhu yodaha kukufisa mbuli. Ona, Yoabu niiyo yanilagilize na yanilongele mbuli za kulonga. <verse eid="2SA 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 14:20" />Yoabu katenda ivo muladi ugalule magesa yako kusonhela Abisalomu. Mbali weye, mwenevale wangu kuna ubala fana viya wasenga wa kuulanga wa Mulungu na kovimanya chila chinhu chochilawilila muna iisi.”<verse eid="2SA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 14:21" />Mfalume kalagiliza Yoabu yagaligwe, viyafikile kamulongela, “Notogola na kutenda. Lelo mbweleze ukaye mbwanga ija Abisalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 14:22" />Yoabu kagwa hasi chingubingubi na katumbala mavindi mbaka chihanga chake chidalisa hasi, maabaho kamtemela mate mfalume, kalonga, “Diyelo niye msang'hani wako novimanya kuwa nitogoligwa haulongozi wako kwaviya kunitendela chinipulile.”<verse eid="2SA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 14:23" />Ivo Yoabu kahita Geshuli kumbweleza Abisalomu Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 14:24" />Mbali mfalume kalonga, “Abisalomu yahite kwiikaye yake. Kolondeka sekeyachiwone chihanga changu.” Ivo Abisalomu kahita kuna ikaye yake na hachiwone chihanga cha mfalume.<verse eid="2SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi komulekelela Abisalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 14:25" />Muna isi yose ya Isilaili habule hata munhu imwe yatogoligwe kuwa kanoga fana Abisalomu, kwandusila hadidosi jake mbaka muna ulwayo kakala yatelele lukuli lwose. <verse eid="2SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 14:26" />Chila lusita viyawegule nyele zake, kwa viya kakala yowegula mwanza umwe kwa mwaka, nyele zake zikala zizamile ng'hani. Viyazipimile zikala chilo mbili kwa chipimo cha chifalume. <verse eid="2SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 14:27" />Abisalomu kakala na wana watatu wachilume, hamwe na mndele imwe zina jake Tamali, yoyakalile lumondo.<verse eid="2SA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 14:28" />Abisalomu kakala Yelusalemu miyaka midi bila ya kumuwona mfalume. <verse eid="2SA 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 14:29" />Maabaho Abisalomu kamtanga Yoabu kwa lungilo da kumtuma kwa mfalume, mbali Yoabu kalema kwiza kwa Abisalomu. Maabaho kamtanga mwanza wekaidi, mbali kalema kwiza. <verse eid="2SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 14:30" />Ivo Abisalomu kawalongela wasang'hani wake, “Loleni Yoabu kana mgunda wa shaili habehi na mgunda wangu, hiteni mukaulunguze.” Ivo wasang'hani wa Abisalomu waulunguza mgunda wa Yoabu kwa moto.<verse eid="2SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 14:31" />Yoabu kahita ukaye kwa Abisalomu kumuuza, “Habali wasang'hani wako waulunguza mgunda wangu?”<verse eid="2SA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 14:32" />Abisalomu kamwidika Yoabu, “Lola nikugalila usenga kwiza kuno nidahe kukutuma kwa mfalume kumulongela, ‘Vino habali nisegela Geshuli? Yahawile vinoga kumwangu kusigala uko.’ Lelo nitaze kumuwona mfalume. One nina ubananzi nayanikome.”<verse eid="2SA 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 14:33" />Yoabu kahita na kumulongela mfalume mbuli izo zose. Maabaho Daudi kamtanga Abisalomu, nayo kengila kwa mfalume na kamtumbalila mavindi mbaka chihanga chidalisa hasi. Na mfalume kamnonela Abisalomu.<verse eid="2SA 14:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2SA 15" />
  <para style="s">Abisalomu koilunga kutenda mbuli zihilie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 15:1" />Vizifosile mbuli izo, Abisalomu kasasala matololi ya kubululigwa na falasi hamwe na watowang'hondo malongo matano wakimbile haulongozi wake. <verse eid="2SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 15:2" />Abisalomu kazowela kulamuka mitondo ng'hani na kuhita kwima kuna inzila yoisonhela kuna ulwivi ulukulu wa bululu. Munhu yoyose yakalile na mbuli yoyalondile kuigala kwa mfalume muladi kupata ulamuzi wake, Abisalomu komtanga munhu iyo hamgwazo na kumuuza, “Weye kolawa bululu dilihi?” One yahedike, “Niye msang'hani wako nolawa dimwe da makabila ya Isilaili.” <verse eid="2SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 15:3" />Abisalomu komulongela munhu iyo, “Lola, mbuli yako inoga ng'hani, mbali habule munhu yasaguligwe na mfalume kukuhumiza.” <verse eid="2SA 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 15:4" />Kaidi Abisalomu komulongela, “One nihawile msemi wa isi ya Isilaili, chila munhu yeli na manyulunyulu hebu mbuli yahezile kumwangu na hamuhumize fana viilondeka.”<verse eid="2SA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 15:5" />Iviya, munhu yoyose yamkwenhukile na kumtumbalila mavindi haulongozi wake, Abisalomu kogolosa makono na kamuhagatila na kumnonela. <verse eid="2SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 15:6" />Ivo niivo Abisalomu viyawatendele Waisilaili wose wowezile kwa mfalume muladi yawahumize. Kwa kutenda ivo, Abisalomu kawatenda wanhu wa Isilaili wamulonde kufosa Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 15:7" />Viifosile miyaka mine, Abisalomu kamulongela mfalume, “Nolamba unilekelele nihite uko Hebuloni muladi nifikize chiya chonimulahile Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="2SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 15:8" />Vinikalile Geshuli muna iisi ya Shamu, nimulahila Mndewa Mulungu nilonga, ‘One Mndewa Mulungu konibweleza kudibululu da Yelusalemu nizamtambikila uko Hebuloni.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 15:9" />Mfalume kamwidika, “Hita kwa tindiwalo.” Abisalomu kahita Hebuloni. <verse eid="2SA 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 15:10" />Mbali Abisalomu katuma usenga wa chifiso kwa makabila yose ya Isilaili kulonga, “Hondamuhulike dizi da mhalati, baho longeni, ‘Abisalomu ni mfalume uko Hebuloni!’ ” <verse eid="2SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 15:11" />Abisalomu viyahitile uko Hebuloni, kahita na wanhu magana maidi kulawa Yelusalemu. Nawo wahita uko kwa lungilo dinogile na hawavimanyile chochose choyailungile Abisalomu. <verse eid="2SA 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 15:12" />Abisalomu viyakalile yolava nhambiko, katuma usenga kumtanga Ahitofeli Mgiloni kulawa kuna dibululu jake da Gilo. Yeye kakala yomwing'ha magesa yake Daudi. Lungilo dihile da Abisalomu jongezeka kupata nguvu na wanhu wowamsondelele Abisalomu wakala wokongezeka.<verse eid="2SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi koibanga kulawa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 15:13" />Msenga keza kumulongela Daudi, “Waisilaili wonogelwa na Abisalomu.”<verse eid="2SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 15:14" />Ivo Daudi kawalongela wasang'hani wake wowakalile nayo Yelusalemu, “Inukeni chikimbile, one hachitendile ivo, hachidaha kumbanga Abisalomu! Cholondeka chisegele himahima sekeyeze kuchigalila ndilo na kudinanga bululu kwa panga!”<verse eid="2SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 15:15" />Mbali wasang'hani wake wamulongela, “Weye mwenevale wetu mfalume, cheye wasang'hani wako. Chiisasala kutenda chochose chondaulonge.” <verse eid="2SA 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 15:16" />Ivo mfalume kasegela hamwe na kaye yake, mbali kawaleka wake zake iwadodo longo kuilolesa goya kaye yake.<verse eid="2SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 15:17" />Ivo mfalume na wanhu wake wose wasegela. Mbali wema chidogo viwafikile kaye ya uhelelo ya kudibululu. <verse eid="2SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 15:18" />Wasang'hani wose wa mfalume na Wakelesi wose na Wapelesi wose, hamwe na Wagiti magana sita wowamsondelele mfalume Daudi kulawa kuna dibululu da Gasi, wasegela hamwe nayo na wamulongolela. <verse eid="2SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 15:19" />Maabaho mfalume Daudi kamuuza Itayi Mgiti, “Habali hata weye kusegela hamwe na cheye? Bwela ukaye na kala na mfalume iyo wa sambi, kwaviya weye siyo mkaya wa isi ino, iviya kwa mfosanzila kulawa kuna iisi yako. <verse eid="2SA 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 15:20" />Weye kwiza kuno zuzizuzi muhala. Habali kuisondelela na cheye hata niye sikumanya konihita? Bwela ukaye hamwe na ndugu zako. Nayo Mndewa Mulungu yakulagusile ulondo wake wa kufunya umoyo na uwaminika wake.”<verse eid="2SA 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 15:21" />Mbali Itayi kamwidika mfalume, “Fana viya viyokala Mndewa Mulungu na weye mwenevale wangu viukala, hohose hondauwe, one ihawa nodanganika hebu nosigala mgima, niye msang'hani wako nizakuwa baho.”<verse eid="2SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 15:22" />Daudi kamulongela Itayi Mgiti, “Longola kuulongozi!” Bahaja Itayi kahita hamwe na watowang'hondo wake na kaye zawo.<verse eid="2SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 15:23" />Daudi viyakalile kosegela hamwe na wanhu wake, wanhu wa Yelusalemu walila kwa dizi kulu. Mfalume Daudi kaloka muna ichizanda cha Chidiloni hamwe na wanhu wake wose. Wofosa kusonhela kuichuwala.<verse eid="2SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 15:24" />Sadoki kakala haja na Walawi wowakalile wadipapa sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu. Wadika hasi sanduku da lagano da Mndewa Mulungu, Abiasali kakala uko mbaka wanhu wose viwasegele. <verse eid="2SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 15:25" />Maabaho mfalume kamulongela Sadoki, “Dibweleze disanduku da lagano kudibululu. One Mndewa Mulungu kanogelwa na niye, kezanibweleza na kunilekela kuwona kaidi sanduku ijo na hanhu hodikala. <verse eid="2SA 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 15:26" />Mbali one Mndewa Mulungu hanogelwa na niye, niye niisasala yanitendele chochose choyowona chinoga.”<verse eid="2SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 15:27" />Mfalume kamulongela mkulu wa nhambiko Sadoki, “Weye kodaha kuchiwona chochilawilila hano, lelo msole mwanago Ahimaasi na Yonasani mwana wa Abiasali na mubwele ukaye kwa tindiwalo. <verse eid="2SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 15:28" />Mbali nizagozela hana iviloko kuno kuna ichuwala, mbaka vondanipate mbuli kulawa kumwako.” <verse eid="2SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 15:29" />Ivo Sadoki na Abiasali wadibweleza sanduku da lagano da Mulungu kuna dibululu da Yelusalemu na wasigala umo.<verse eid="2SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 15:30" />Mbali Daudi kagendelela kukwela Mulima wa Mizaituni kuno kolila. Kahita bila ya vilatu na kuno kaigubika ditwi jake. Wanhu wose wowakalile hamwe nayo wagubika matwi yawo. Wakala wokwela mulima kuno wolila. <verse eid="2SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 15:31" />Lusita ulo Daudi kalongiligwa kuwa Ahitofeli kakala yomtaza Abisalomu kuilungila vinhu vihile kusonhela yeye. Baho Daudi kapula na kalonga, “Weye Mndewa Mulungu, ugalule magesa ya Ahitofeli kuwa ubozi.”<verse eid="2SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 15:32" />Daudi viyafikile kuna uludonho wa mulima hanhu haja wanhu howazowele kumtambikila Mulungu, Hushai Mwaliki kakala uko kumgozela kuno viwalo vake videgeka na kana matimbwisi mditwi jake kulagusa kana usungu. <verse eid="2SA 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 15:33" />Daudi kamulongela, “One uhahita hamwe na niye, kwizakuwa mbahasha kumwangu. <verse eid="2SA 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 15:34" />Mbali ubwele kudibululu ukamulongele Abisalomu, ‘Weye mfalume, nizakuwa msang'hani wako. Lusita lufosile nikala msang'hani wa tati yako, mbali sambi nizakuwa msang'hani wako.’ Kwa kutenda ivo kwizanitaza kulema gesa da Ahitofeli. <verse eid="2SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 15:35" />Vino wakulu wa nhambiko Sadoki na Abiasali hawezakuwa hamwe na weye? Walongele chochose chondauhulike muna ikaye ya mfalume. <verse eid="2SA 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 15:36" />Lola wanawo waidi, Ahimaasi mwana wa Sadoki na Yonasani mwana wa Abiasali wahamwe nawo. Na weye uwatume wawo wanigalile mbuli zose zondauhulike.”<verse eid="2SA 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 15:37" />Ivo Hushai mbwiyake Daudi kafika Yelusalemu na lusita ulwo Abisalomu kengila uko Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 15:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Daudi na Siba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 16:1" />Daudi viyakalile kalufosa chidogo ludonho lwa umulima, kamfika uko Siba msang'hani wa Mefiboshesi kakala baho kumuhokela Daudi. Kuno kana vihongwe waidi niwawo wowakalile wapapa magate magana maidi na vipambo gana va zabibu zinyalile, matunda gana ya lusita lwa chiyangazi na chiya chimemile divai.<verse eid="2SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 16:2" />Mfalume kamuuza Siba, “Habali kugala vinhu vino vose?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:2">Siba kamwidika, “Vihongwe kwa ichimu cha kukwela ndugu zako, gate na matunda kwa wanhu kuja, divai ya kung'wa wanhu hondawalegele muna ichuwala.”<verse eid="2SA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 16:3" />Mfalume kamuuza, “Mefiboshesi kakulihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:3">Siba kamwidika, “Kasigala umo Yelusalemu, kwaviya kochilongela, ‘Lelo, wanhu wa Isilaili wezanibwelezela ufalume wa wasaho yangu.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 16:4" />Mfalume kamulongela Siba, “Chila chinhu cha Mefiboshesi ni chako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 16:4">Siba kamwidika, “Niye msang'hani wako, notumbala mavindi haulongozi wako mwenevale wangu mfalume, niye nolamba nipate kutogoligwa kumwako.”<verse eid="2SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shimei komduwila Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 16:5" />Mfalume Daudi viyafikile bululu da Bahulimu, imwe wa lukolo lwa Sauli yotangigwa Shimei mwana wa Gela, kalawa uko. Kamduwila Daudi viyakalile yogenda. <verse eid="2SA 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 16:6" />Shimei kandusa kumpigisila mabwe Daudi na wasang'hani wake, ingawa Daudi kakala kazungulukigwa na wanhu na wakalizi wake. <verse eid="2SA 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 16:7" />Shimei kamduwila Daudi kalonga, “Segela! Segela! Mkomaji! Weye hufaya! <verse eid="2SA 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 16:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kalihiliza chisasi kwa ichimu cha kuwakoma wanhu wose wa kaye ya Sauli, ija weye kusola ufalume hanhu hake. Lelo Mndewa Mulungu kamwing'ha Abisalomu. Lola lelo kunangigwa kukupata kwaviya weye ni mkomaji.”<verse eid="2SA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 16:9" />Abishai mwana wa Seluya kamulongela mfalume, “Habali ino umbwa yafile kokuduwila weye, mwenevale wangu mfalume? Nilekele nimuhitile nidumule ditwi jake.”<verse eid="2SA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 16:10" />Mfalume kamulongela Abishai na ndugu yake, “Mbuli iyo siyo yenu mweye wana wa Seluya. One Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Shimei, ‘Mduwile Daudi,’ vino yelihi yodaha kumkimilila sekeyatende ivo?”<verse eid="2SA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 16:11" />Daudi kamulongela Abishai na wasang'hani wake wose, “One mwanangu kolonda kunikoma, siyo chinhu cha kwazanya ndugu wa Sauli kulonda kunikoma. One Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela, yaniduwile. Mulekeni yakale na mulekeni yatende ivo. <verse eid="2SA 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 16:12" />Yodahika Mndewa Mulungu kezalola manhesa yangu, nayo kezaniliha mbuli zinogile kwa duwilo dino donidipata diyelo.” <verse eid="2SA 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 16:13" />Daudi na wanhu wake wagendelela na mwanza mudikulugumbi. Kuno Shimei kagendelela mumgwazogwazo mwa chilima, wagenda malola kuno komduwila na kompigisila Daudi mabwe na timbwisi. <verse eid="2SA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 16:14" />Mfalume hamwe na wanhu wose wowakalile nayo, wafika muulwanda lwa Yoludani kuno walegela na wahumula.<verse eid="2SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abisalomu kokwingila Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 16:15" />Abisalomu hamwe na Waisilaili wose, wengila Yelusalemu. Ahitofeli kakala hamwe nayo. <verse eid="2SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 16:16" />Hushai Mwaliki, mbwiya wa Daudi kamuhitila Abisalomu na kamulongela, “Mfalume yakale siku zose!”<verse eid="2SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 16:17" />Abisalomu kamuuza Hushai, “Vino uno ulondo woulagusa kwa mbwiyako? Habali huhitile hamwe na mbwiyako?”<verse eid="2SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 16:18" />Hushai kamwidika Abisalomu, “Siivo bule, niye nizasigala na munhu ija yasaguligwe na Mndewa Mulungu na wanhu wano na Waisilaili wose. Nizakuwa wake yeye. <verse eid="2SA 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 16:19" />Iviya, yelihi yondanimsang'hanile? Vino nimsang'hanile mwanage? Fana viya vinimsang'hanile tati yako, niivo vondanikusang'hanile weye.”<verse eid="2SA 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 16:20" />Abisalomu kamulongela Ahitofeli, “Ching'he magesa yako. Chitende choni?”<verse eid="2SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 16:21" />Ahitofeli kamwidika Abisalomu, “Wabandame wake wadodo wa tati yako woyawalekile kulolesa goya kaye yake. Uhatenda ivo, wanhu wose wa Isilaili wezahulika kuwa kwihiligwa na tati yako, maabaho wanhu wose weli ubanzi wako wezapata nguvu.” <verse eid="2SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 16:22" />Ivo wanhu wamwikila hema Abisalomu uchanyha ya chisuwili chibadagale, nayo kawabandama wake wadodo wa tati yake kuno Waisilaili wolola.<verse eid="2SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 16:23" />Siku izo chiyalongile Ahitofeli chikala fana viya chilongigwa na Mulungu. Lekamana Daudi na Abisalomu wasondelela mbuli yoyalongile Ahitofeli.<verse eid="2SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2SA 17" />
  <para style="s">Hushai komwagiza Abisalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 17:1" />Ahitofeli kamulongela Abisalomu, “Nilekele nisagule wanhu 12,000, nimsondelele Daudi ichilo chino. <verse eid="2SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 17:2" />Nizamtowa kuno kalegela na kufa moyo na nizamtenda yadumbe na wanhu wake wose wezakimbila. Nizamkoma mfalume muhala, <verse eid="2SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 17:3" />na kuwabweleza wanhu wose kumwako, fana viya mhambe viyobwela ukaye kwa mulumake. Weye kouzahila ugima wa munhu imwe muhala na wanhu wamwenga wezakuwa na tindiwalo.” <verse eid="2SA 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 17:4" />Mbuli ino ya Ahitofeli imnogeza Abisalomu na walala wose wa Isilaili.<verse eid="2SA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 17:5" />Maabaho Abisalomu kalonga, “Lelo mtange Hushai Mwaliki muladi chimtegeleze choyolonda kulonga.” <verse eid="2SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 17:6" />Hushai viyafikile, Abisalomu kamulongela, “Dino niijo gesa da Ahitofeli doyaching'hile, vino cholondeka chidisondelele? One siivo, uchilongele mbuli ya kutenda.”<verse eid="2SA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 17:7" />Hushai kamwidika Abisalomu, “Mbuli yailongile Ahitofeli hainogile.” <verse eid="2SA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 17:8" />Hushai kamulongela, “Weye kovimanya kuwa tati yako na wanhu wake ni magalu na wana ludoko fana dubu zike muichuwala yoyahokigwe wanage. Kufosa yayo, kwaviya tati yako ni galu wa ng'hondo, hezakala hamwe na watowang'hondo wake ichilo. <verse eid="2SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 17:9" />Mbaka sambi kaifisa muna idituka hebu hanhu hamwenga ha kuifisa. Munhu yoyose imwenga yondayahulike kukomigwa kwa wanhu muna umwanduso wa ng'hondo, kezalonga kuwa ukomaji ulawilila muna dibumbila da Abisalomu. <verse eid="2SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 17:10" />Wanhu wose wahahulika ivo, hata waja wanhu wako magalu weli na mizoyo igangamale fana simba, wezalipuka moyo kwa kudumba. Mana Waisilaili wose wavimanya kuwa tati yako galu na wose weli hamwe nayo magalu. <verse eid="2SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 17:11" />Lelo niye nogesa, uwakunzagize Waisilaili wose kulawa mwanduso wa isi uko Dani mbaka uhelelo wa isi uko Belisheba, wawe wengi fana msanga wa bahali. Weye mwenyewo uhite kuing'hondo. <verse eid="2SA 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 17:12" />Cheye chizamuhitila Daudi hanhu hohose hondayapatike. Chizamzamhila fana viya tungwe vidigwa muna iisi na kugubika chila chinhu. Habule munhu yondayasigale mgima, yeye mwenyewo hebu wanhu wake weli hamwe nayo. <verse eid="2SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 17:13" />One yahakimbilila bululu dimwenga, Waisilaili wose wezagala nzabi na kukwega mabwe ya mhongono ya bululu ijo mbaka kuna dikolongo. Habule chinhu chochose chondachisigale, hata dibwe dodo da bululu ijo.”<verse eid="2SA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 17:14" />Abisalomu hamwe na wanhu wose wa Isilaili walonga, “Gesa da Hushai Mwaliki dinoga kufosa gesa da Ahitofeli.” Wadilema gesa da Ahitofeli kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kailunga kudilema gesa dinogile da Ahitofeli muladi yadahe kumgalila Abisalomu ifa.<verse eid="2SA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi kozumigwa na kwiibanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 17:15" />Hushai kawalongela Sadoki na Abiasali wakulu wa nhambiko, “Ahitofeli kawalongela Abisalomu na walala wa Isilaili viya va kutenda, niye niwalongela wawo kutenda vinhu vimwenga. <verse eid="2SA 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 17:16" />Galeni usenga himahima na mulongeleni Daudi, ‘Ichilo sekeugone kuna iviloko va kuichuwala, mbali hita bila kuswela muladi mfalume na wanhu wake sekewakomigwe.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 17:17" />Yonasani na Ahimaasi wakala wogozela kuna inzasa ya Eni Logeli. Msang'hani imwe wa chike wa Sadoki na Abiasali kawagalila usenga uwo Yonasani na Ahimaasi wahite kumulongela mfalume Daudi, kwaviya hawalondile kuwoneka mudibululu da Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 17:18" />Mbali lusita luno, wawoneka na mbwanga imwe yoyahitile kumulongela Abisalomu. Ivo Yonasani na Ahimaasi wasegela himahima na wahita uko Bahulimu kuna ikaye ya munhu imwe yoyakalile na chisima kuuluwa lwake. Wengila umo muna ichisima na kwiifisa. <verse eid="2SA 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 17:19" />Muke wa munhu iyo kasola ngubiko na kuchigubika chisima icho maabaho kanika ngano. Kwa ivo habule munhu yavimanyile kuwa kuna wanhu mgati. <verse eid="2SA 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 17:20" />Wasang'hani wa Abisalomu viwafikile muna ikaye, wamuuza muke iyo, “ Wakulihi Ahimaasi na Yonasani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Muke iyo kawedika, “Waloka ulwanda.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 17:20">Wasang'hani wa Abisalomu wawazahila mbali hawawapatile bule, ivo wabwela kudibululu da Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 17:21" />Wasang'hani wa Abisalomu viwasegele, Yonasani na Ahimaasi walawa kunze ya ichisima. Wahita kwa mfalume Daudi na kumulongela, “Loka umwambu wa ulwanda himahima, kwaviya Ahitofeli kamwing'ha magesa yehile Abisalomu kusonhela weye.” <verse eid="2SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 17:22" />Daudi na wanhu wose wowakalile hamwe nayo, wandusa kuloka lwanda lwa Yoludani. Wanhu wose wakomeleza kuloka viifikile imitondo.<verse eid="2SA 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 17:23" />Ahitofeli viyawone kuwa magesa yake yalemigwa, kasasala chihongwe wake na kahita ukaye kuna idibululu jake. Viyafikile ukaye yake, keka goya mbuli zake, maabaho kaitumbika mwenyewo na kadanganika. Kawandigwa kuna dileme da tati yake.<verse eid="2SA 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 17:24" />Daudi kahita uko Mahanaimu, Abisalomu kaloka Yoludani hamwe na watowang'hondo wose wa Waisilaili. <verse eid="2SA 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 17:25" />Abisalomu kamsagula Amasa kuwa mkulu wa watowang'hondo hanhu ha Yoabu. Amasa kakala mwana wa Yeseli Muisilaili yamsolile Abigaili mami yake Nahashi. Nahashi kakala na mwali yatangigwe Seluya, mami yake Yoabu. <verse eid="2SA 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 17:26" />Waisilaili na Abisalomu weka lago jawo muna iisi ya Gileadi.<verse eid="2SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 17:27" />Daudi viyafikile Mahanaimu, Shobi na Makili na Balizilai wakala baho. Shobi kakala mwana wa Nahashi Mwamoni yoyalawile bululu da Laba. Makili kakala mwana wa Amieli yoyalawile bululu da Lodebali. Balizilai kakala Mgileadi kulawa bululu da Logelimu. <verse eid="2SA 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 17:28" />Wagala malili na nongo na via va ulongo, iviya wagala ngano na shayili na usage na uhishi na ng'hunde na dengu na <verse eid="2SA 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 17:29" />uki na siagi na ng'hondolo na mtindi kulawa muna imifugo yawo kwa ichimu cha Daudi na wanhu wowakalile nayo. Wagala vinhu ivo kwaviya wavimanya kuwa wanhu waja wakala walegele na wana nzala na ng'hilu kwa ichimu cha kugenda muna ichuwala.<verse eid="2SA 17:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2SA 18" />
  <para style="s">Abisalomu kokomigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 18:1" />Daudi kawakunzagiza watowang'hondo wake hamwe, kawagola muna yamabumbila ya watowang'hondo gana gana na muna yamabumbila ya watowang'hondo maelufu, maabaho keka mulangulizi chila bumbila. <verse eid="2SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 18:2" />Daudi kawagola watowang'hondo wose mabumbila matatu. Kamsagula Yoabu kulanguliza bumbila da mwanduso. Kamsagula Abishai mdodo wake Yoabu, mami yawo katangigwa Seluya kulanguliza bumbila dekaidi na kamsagula Itayi mkaya wa Gasi kulanguliza bumbila deketatu. Maabaho mfalume Daudi kawalongela wose, “Niye mwenyewo nohita na mweye.”<verse eid="2SA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 18:3" />Mbali wanhu wamwidika, “Hwizahita na cheye bule. One chihakimbila hawezachigesa bule, one nusu yetu wahadanganika, hawezachigesa bule. Mbali ugima wako ulinga fana ugima wa wanhu maelufu longo hagati yetu. Ivo yolondeka weye usigale mudibululu na uchigalile nhazo kuno kuchuwala.”<verse eid="2SA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 18:4" />Mfalume kawedika, “Nizatenda chiya chimgesa kuwa chinoga ng'hani.” Maabaho mfalume kema hamgwazo wa lwivi lukulu lwa bululu, wanhu wawo walawa kunze kwa mabumbila ya magana na maelufu. <verse eid="2SA 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 18:5" />Mfalume kawalongela Yoabu na Abishai na Itayi, “Mtendeleni ija imbwanga Abisalomu kwa uhole kwa ichimu changu.” Nawo mabumbila yose wahulika malagilizo ya mfalume viyawalagilize kwa chila mkulu wa watowang'hondo kusonhela Abisalomu.<verse eid="2SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 18:6" />Watowang'hondo wa Daudi wahita hanhu ha kuitowa na Isilaili. Ivo waitowa kuna imbago ya Efulaimu. <verse eid="2SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 18:7" />Watowang'hondo wa Isilaili wahumigwa na watowang'hondo wa Daudi na wakomigwe wakala wengi ng'hani, nawo wawa 20,000. <verse eid="2SA 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 18:8" />Ng'hondo yenela muna iisi yose na peta ya wanhu wadanganika muna imbago ikala ng'hulu kufosa peta ya wanhu wowakomigwe na wehi.<verse eid="2SA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 18:9" />Maabaho Abisalomu kaiting'hana na wanhu wa Daudi. Abisalomu kakala kakwela mnyama yalingile fana chihongwe, nayo kafosa hasi ya biki kulu, ditwi da Abisalomu jangama muna ditambi. Mnyama iyo kakimbila kuulongozi wake. Abisalomu kalekigwa kotinga mchanyha mdibiki.<verse eid="2SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 18:10" />Munhu yamuwonile kamulongela Yoabu, “Nimuwona Abisalomu kotinga mdibiki dikulu.” <verse eid="2SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 18:11" />Yoabu kamulongela munhu iyo yamwing'hile usenga, “Vino weye kumuwona kweli? Habali humkanhile bahobaho mbaka yadanganike? Baho nahakwing'hile hela shekeli longo hamwe na gweko da mkwiji wa mtowang'hondo galu.”<verse eid="2SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 18:12" />Mbali munhu iyo kamwidika Yoabu, “One ihawile nopata hela shekeli magana longo mmakono yangu, sigambeniugolose mkono wangu kumtowa mwanage mfalume. Kuno chihulika kuwa mfalume kakulagiliza weye na Abishai hamwe na Itayi, kalonga, ‘Mkalizeni ng'hani mbwanga iyo Abisalomu.’ <verse eid="2SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 18:13" />One nihamkomile, habule jojose doifisa kwa mfalume na weye mwenyewo uhakalile kutali na niye.”<verse eid="2SA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 18:14" />Yoabu kalonga, “Lola, niye sikalama hano na weye.” Ivo kasola migoha mitatu mmakono yake na kamuhoma nayo Abisalomu muumoyo kuno yang'hali mgima muna umbiki mkulu. <verse eid="2SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 18:15" />Maabaho watowang'hondo longo weli wapagazi wa via va ng'hondo va Yoabu wamzunguluka Abisalomu, wamtowa na kumkoma.<verse eid="2SA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 18:16" />Yoabu katowa mhalati na mabumbila ya watowang'hondo yaleka kuwawinga watowang'hondo wa Isilaili, kwaviya Yoabu kawakimilila. <verse eid="2SA 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 18:17" />Wamsola Abisalomu na wamwasa muna dikombo kulu uko kwiimbago na kwika bugulu kulu da mabwe mchanyha yake. Waisilaili wose wakimbilila muizikaye zawo.<verse eid="2SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 18:18" />Abisalomu viyakalile hanapata wana, kasola mhanda na kaisimika muna Dibawe da Mfalume, kwaviya kagesa, “Nabule mwana wa chilume yondayagendese zina jangu.” Kaitanga mhanda iyo kwa zina jake mwenyewo. Nayo yotangigwa mhanda ya Abisalomu mbaka diyelo.<verse eid="2SA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi komulilila Abisalomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 18:19" />Maabaho Ahimaasi mwana wa Sadoki kalonga, “Nileke nikimbile nimgalile usenga mfalume kuwa Mndewa Mulungu kamulopola mfalume kulawa kwa wehi wake.”<verse eid="2SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 18:20" />Yoabu kamulongela Ahimaasi, “Diyelo siyo weye yondaugale usenga. Kodaha kugala usenga lusita lumwenga mbali siyo diyelo, kwaviya mwanage mfalume kadanganika.”<verse eid="2SA 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 18:21" />Maabaho Yoabu kamulongela munhu imwe Mkushi, “Hita ukamulongele mfalume chiya chouwone.” Mkushi kainama haulongozi wa Yoabu maabaho kahita yokimbila.<verse eid="2SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 18:22" />Ahimaasi mwana wa Sadoki kamulongela kaidi Yoabu, “Dondadiwe na diwe, nolamba leka nimsondelele Mkushi iyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:22">Mbali Yoabu kamwidika, “Mwanangu, habali weye kolonda kuhita? Weye kwabule mbuli yoyose yondaikupatile gweko kwa mfalume.”<verse eid="2SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 18:23" />Ahimaasi kalonga, “Dondadiwe na diwe, nolonda kukimbila.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:23">Ivo Yoabu kamulongela, “Haya kimbila!” Baho Ahimaasi kakimbila kwa kusondelela nzila ya kufosela kuna dibawe, kamulongolela Mkushi kufika.<verse eid="2SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 18:24" />Lusita Daudi viyakalile kakala hagati ya lwivi lukulu lwa mgati na lwa kunze, mkalizi kakwela uchanyha ya chisuwili chibadagale cha lwivi lukulu kufosela muinhumba. Viyalolile kunze kamuwona munhu kokwiza yokimbila yaidumwe. <verse eid="2SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 18:25" />Mkalizi kalandula dizi, kamulongela mfalume mbuli iyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:25">Mfalume kalonga, “One kadumwe, kana mbuli inogile.” Munhu ija kaiyoha kukwesa habehi.<verse eid="2SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 18:26" />Maabaho mkalizi kamuwona munhu imwenga kokwiza yokimbila, kamulongela mkalizi wa lwivi, “Lola munhu imwenga kokwiza yokimbila yaidumwe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:26">Mfalume kamwidika, “Iviya ino nayo kogala mbuli inogile.”<verse eid="2SA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 18:27" />Mkalizi kalonga, “Nowona ija wa mwanduso yokimbila kalinga fana Ahimaasi mwana wa Sadoki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:27">Mfalume kedika, “Yeye munhu yanogile na kogala mbuli inogile.”<verse eid="2SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 18:28" />Maabaho Ahimaasi kalandula dizi, “Mbuli zose zinoga!” Katumbala mavindi mbaka chihanga chake chidalisa hasi haulongozi wa mfalume. Kalonga, “Yatogoligwe Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako yawahumile wehi wako, mwenevale wangu mfalume.”<verse eid="2SA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 18:29" />Mfalume kauza, “Vino mbwanga Abisalomu mgima?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:29">Ahimaasi kamwidika, “Yoabu viyanitumile niye msang'hani wako, niwona tibwilitibwili kulu, mbali nipotwa kuvimanya chiya chilawilile.”<verse eid="2SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 18:30" />Mfalume kamulongela, “Ima hamgwazo na gozela hano.” Ahimaasi kema hamgwazo na kagozela.<verse eid="2SA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 18:31" />Maabaho Mkushi nayo kafika na kalonga, “Nina mbuli inogile kwa mwenevale wangu mfalume, kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kakulihilizila chisasi kwa waja wose wakulemile.”<verse eid="2SA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 18:32" />Mfalume kamuuza Mkushi, “Vino mbwanga Abisalomu mgima?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 18:32">Iyo Mkushi kamwidika, “Wehi wa mwenevale wangu mfalume na waja wakulemile, wawe fana mbwanga iyo.”<verse eid="2SA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 18:33" />Mfalume kengilwa na usungu. Kakwela muna ichiheleto chikalile uchanyha ya lwivi lukulu lwa bululu na kalila. Viyakalile yohita kalila, “Weye mwanangu Abisalomu! Weye mwanangu! Mwanangu Abisalomu! Nihadanganike niye mbali siyo weye Abisalomu mwanangu, mwanangu!”<verse eid="2SA 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2SA 19" />
  <para style="s">Yoabu komkalikila Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 19:1" />Yoabu kalongeligwa, “Mfalume Daudi kolila na kumtendela nhanga Abisalomu.” <verse eid="2SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 19:2" />Kwa bumbila jose da watowang'hondo wa Daudi, uhumi wa siku ija ugaluka kuwa ndilo, kwaviya siku iyo wahulika, “Mfalume kana usungu kwa ichimu cha mwanage.” <verse eid="2SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 19:3" />Siku ija watowang'hondo wengila Mahanaimu hupi, fana viya watowang'hondo wowokimbila ng'hondo kwa chinyala. <verse eid="2SA 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 19:4" />Mfalume kaigubika chihanga chake na kalila kwa dizi kulu, “Weye mwanangu Abisalomu! Weye Abisalomu, mwanangu, mwanangu!”<verse eid="2SA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 19:5" />Maabaho Yoabu kengila muna ikaye ya mfalume na kalonga, “Diyelo kuwaguma chinyala wanhu wako wose wowaulopole ugima wako na ugima wa wanago wa chilume na wandele zako na ugima wa wanaake wako na wake zako wadodo, <verse eid="2SA 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 19:6" />kwaviya kuwalonda wehi wako na kuwehila waja wokulonda. Diyelo kulagusa kuwa, wakulu wa watowang'hondo na wasang'hani wako siyo chinhu kumwako. Ivo niwona, one Abisalomu yawile mgima na cheye chose chihadanganike, weye wahadeng'helele. <verse eid="2SA 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 19:7" />Lelo ulawe kunze ukawagume moyo wanhu wako. Noilaha kwa Mndewa Mulungu one hulawa kunze, habule munhu yondayasigale mbaka vondaifike ichigulogulo. Vino vizakuwa viha ng'hani kumwako kufosa manhesa yose yakufikile kwandusila viukalile mbwanga mbaka vino sambi.”<verse eid="2SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 19:8" />Baho mfalume kasegela na kakala hana ichigoda chake habehi na ulwivi lukulu wa bululu. Wanhu viwalongeligwe kuwa mfalume kakala habehi na lwivi lukulu, wanhu wose wamuhitila.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2SA 19:8">Daudi koisasala kubwela Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:8">Lusita ulwo wanhu wose wa Isilaili wakala wakimbila chila imwe kuikaye yake. <verse eid="2SA 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 19:9" />Makabila yose ya Isilaili, wanhu wakala woisosokanya wawo kwa wawo, walonga, “Mfalume kachilopola kulawa kwa wehi wetu. Niiyo yachilopole kulawa kwa Wafilisiti. Mbali sambi mfalume kaikimbila isi kwa ichimu cha Abisalomu, <verse eid="2SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 19:10" />nayo Abisalomu yochimuhaka mavuta kuwa mfalume wetu kadanganika kwiing'hondo. Kwa viya hamulonga jojose kumbweleza mfalume?”<verse eid="2SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 19:11" />Mfalume Daudi viyahulike chiwolonga Waisilaili, kawatuma wakulu wa nhambiko Sadoki na Abiasali wawauze walala wa Yuda, “Habali muwe wa uhelelo kunibweleza niye mfalume muna imhongono yangu? <verse eid="2SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 19:12" />Mweye cha damu imwe. Ivo habali muwe wa uhelelo kunibweleza niye mfalume? <verse eid="2SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 19:13" />Mweye mulongeleni Amasa, ‘Vino weye siyo cha damu imwe? Mulungu yaniduwile hata kunikoma, one sikusagule weye kuwa mkulu wa watowang'hondo wangu kusola hanhu ha Yoabu, kwandusila sambi na kugendelela.’ ”<verse eid="2SA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 19:14" />Wanhu wa Yuda wandusa kumsondelela kaidi Daudi, fana viya wakala munhu imwe. Wagala usenga kwa mfalume walonga, “Bwela na wanhu wako wose.” <verse eid="2SA 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 19:15" />Ivo mfalume viyakalile muinzila kubwela Yelusalemu kafika lwanda lwa Yoludani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:15">Maabaho wanhu wa Yuda waiting'hana Giligali kumulosa mfalume lwanda lwa Yoludani. <verse eid="2SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 19:16" />Shimei mwana wa Gela wa kabila da Benyamini kulawa Bahulimu keza hamwe na wanhu wa Yuda muladi kumuhowela mfalume Daudi. <verse eid="2SA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 19:17" />Hamwe nayo hakala Wabenyamini magana longo. Iviya Siba yakalile mulolesi wa kaye ya Sauli hamwe na wanage longo na tano na wasang'hani wake malongo maidi, wahita himahima Yoludani kuiting'hana na mfalume. <verse eid="2SA 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 19:18" />Waloka chiloko muladi kuwalosa wanhu wa mwiikaye ya mfalume na kutenda chila chinhu chiyalondile mfalume.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:18">Shimei mwana wa Gela viyalokile Yoludani, katumbala mavindi haulongozi wa mfalume. <verse eid="2SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 19:19" />Kamulongela mfalume, “Mwenevale wangu, nokulamba unilekelele wihi wangu. Sekeukumbuke viya niye msang'hani wako vinitendile wihi siku ija viusegele Yelusalemu. Mfalume usegeze muumoyo wako. <verse eid="2SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 19:20" />Kwaviya niye msang'hani wako novimanya nitenda uhasanyi. Mbali diyelo niza fana viya wa mwanduso wa makabila ya Yosefu kuhulumuka na kumuhowela mwenevale wangu mfalume.”<verse eid="2SA 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 19:21" />Mbali Abishai ija mami yake katangigwa Seluya, kalonga, “Vino Shimei halondeka kukomigwa kwa ichimu chino? Kamduwila ija yasaguligwe na Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="2SA 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 19:22" />Daudi kawedika Abishai na sekulu wake Yoabu, “Mweye hamwili hamwe na niye. Habali diyelo muwa wehi wangu? Vino diyelo yakomigwe munhu chakachaka muna iisi ya Isilaili? Hamvimanyile kuwa niye na mfalume wa Isilaili diyelo?” <verse eid="2SA 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 19:23" />Ivo mfalume kamulongela Shimei, “Weye hwizadanganika.” Maabaho mfalume kamulahila.<verse eid="2SA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi kolagusa ubazi kwa Mefiboshesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 19:24" />Maabaho Mefiboshesi mzukulu wa Sauli keza muladi kumuhowela mfalume. Kakala hanawile magulu yake na hawegule ndevu zake na hafuwile mawalo yake kwandusila siku viyasegele mfalume Yelusalemu mbaka siku viyakalile kobwela kwa tindiwalo. <verse eid="2SA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 19:25" />Viyalawile Yelusalemu kumuhowela mfalume, mfalume kamulongela Mefiboshesi, “Habali huhitile hamwe na niye?”<verse eid="2SA 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 19:26" />Nayo kamwidika, “Mwenevale wangu mfalume, msang'hani wangu kanivwizila. Niye msang'hani wako nimulongela Siba, ‘Nikile goya chigoda cha chihongwe nidahe kukwela kuhita hamwe na mfalume.’ Kwaviya niye msang'hani wako ni mbetembete. <verse eid="2SA 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 19:27" />Nayo kakuvwizila weye kusonhela niye msang'hani wako. Mbali weye mwenevale wangu mfalume kulinga fana viya msenga wa kuulanga, ivo tenda jojose diugesa. <verse eid="2SA 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 19:28" />Kwaviya ndugu wose wa tati yangu wakala fana viya wanhu wa kudanganika haulongozi wa mwenevale wangu mfalume, mbali kunika niye msang'hani wako wa iwawo woja mwiimeza yako. Kwa ivo nidahe kumulamba mfalume kwa chinhu chochose?”<verse eid="2SA 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 19:29" />Ivo mfalume kamulongela, “Habali kogendelela kulonga mbuli izo? Niye nolamula, weye na Siba mwiigolele isi.”<verse eid="2SA 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 19:30" />Mefiboshesi kamulongela mfalume, “Mulekele hata vose yasole yeye kwaviya sambi mwenevale wangu mfalume kobwela vinogile.”<verse eid="2SA 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 19:31" />Balizilai Mgileadi kafika kulawa Logelimu muladi yoloke Yoludani hamwe na mfalume. <verse eid="2SA 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 19:32" />Balizilai kakala mulala ng'hani yeli na miyaka malongo manane. Kakala kamwing'ha ndiya mfalume baho viyakalile Mahanaimu kwaviya kakala munhu yeli na vinhu vingi. <verse eid="2SA 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 19:33" />Nayo mfalume kamulongela Balizilai, “Loka hamwe na niye na ukale na niye uko Yelusalemu. Niye nizakwing'ha viya vovilondeka kumwako.”<verse eid="2SA 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 19:34" />Mbali Balizilai kamulongela mfalume, “Vino nina miyaka mingahi ya kukala mbaka nihite na mfalume uko Yelusalemu? <verse eid="2SA 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 19:35" />Nina miyaka malongo manane, vino nodaha kufambula mbuli inogile na ihile? Vino niye msang'hani wako nodaha kuvimanya kulanza chinhu chonija hebu choning'hwa? Vino ning'hali nohulika madizi ya wembaji wa chilume na ya wembaji wa chike? Habali niye msang'hani wako nyongeze mbahasha kwa mwenevale wangu mfalume? <verse eid="2SA 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 19:36" />Niye msang'hani wako nizaloka Yoludani hamwe na mfalume kwa utali mdodo muhala. Mbali habali mfalume kuning'ha gweko fana ijo? <verse eid="2SA 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 19:37" />Nileke niye msang'hani wako nibwele muladi nikadanganikile kuna dibululu jangu mwenyewo habehi na maleme ya tati yangu na mami yangu. Mbali kabahano msang'hani wako Kimhaimu. Muleke yaloke hamwe na weye mwenevale wangu mfalume. Umtendele mbuli zozikunogeza weye.”<verse eid="2SA 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 19:38" />Mfalume kamulongela Balizilai, “Kimhaimu kezaloka Yoludani hamwe na niye na niye nizamtendela mbuli zozikunogeza. Weye iviya nizakutendela mbuli zozikunogeza.”<verse eid="2SA 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 19:39" />Ivo wanhu wose waloka Yoludani, maabaho mfalume nayo kaloka. Mfalume kamnonela Balizilai na kumtemela mate. Balizilai kabwela ukaye yake.<verse eid="2SA 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 19:40" />Mfalume viyalokile kuhita Giligali, Kimhaimu kaloka hamwe nayo. Mabumbila yose ya watowang'hondo wa Yuda na nusu ya mabumbila ya watowang'hondo wa Isilaili wamulosa mfalume.<verse eid="2SA 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 19:41" />Wanhu wose wa Isilaili weza kwa mfalume na kumulongela, “Habali ndugu zetu wanhu wa Yuda wakubweleza weye mfalume kwa mvisa na wakulosa umwambu wa Yoludani, weye na kaye yako hamwe na wanhu wako wose?”<verse eid="2SA 19:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 19:42" />Wanhu wose wa Yuda wawedika wanhu wa Isilaili, “Chitenda vino kwaviya mfalume ni ndugu yetu. Habali muna ludoko na mbuli ino? Vino chija chinhu chochose cha mfalume? Vino chisola chinhu chochose kwa ichimu chetu wenyewo?”<verse eid="2SA 19:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 19:43" />Wanhu wa Isilaili wawedika wanhu wa Yuda, “Cheye niiyo wochilondeka kuwa na mfalume miyanza longo kufosa mweye. Lelo habali mochizeha? Vino hachiwile wa mwanduso kulonga kusonhela kumbweleza mfalume?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 19:43">Mbali wanhu wa Yuda wedika kwa ukali ng'hani kufosa wanhu wa Isilaili.<verse eid="2SA 19:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2SA 20" />
  <para style="s">Sheba koulema utawala wa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 20:1" />Kukala na munhu mtatali ng'hani yatangigwe Sheba mwana wa Bikili Mbenyamini, katowa mhalati na kulandula dizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 20:1">“Cheye siyo wanhu wa Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 20:1">iviya chabule hanhu kwa mwana wa Yese.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 20:1">Mweye wanhu wa Isilaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 20:1">Chila munhu yahite ukaye yake.”<verse eid="2SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 20:2" />Ivo wanhu wose wa Isilaili wamuleka Daudi na kumsondelela Sheba mwana wa Bikili. Mbali wanhu wa Yuda wailumba na mfalume wawo kwandusila Yoludani mbaka Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 20:3" />Daudi viyabwelile ukaye yake muna imhongono ya chifalume uko Yelusalemu, kawasola waja wake zake wadodo longo woyawalekile muladi kukaliza mhongono ya chifalume na kawahindila muna ikaye imwe. Kawalolesa goya, mbali haibandame nawo. Wafungigwa na wakala fana wagane mbaka viwadanganike.<verse eid="2SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 20:4" />Maabaho mfalume kamulongela Amasa, “Niduganyile wanhu wose wa Yuda kwa siku tatu na weye mwenyewo uwe baho.” <verse eid="2SA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 20:5" />Amasa kahita kuwatanga wanhu wa Yuda. Mbali kakalama kubwela kwa lusita luja lowalongeligwe na mfalume.<verse eid="2SA 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 20:6" />Daudi kamulongela Abishai, “Lelo Sheba mwana wa Bikili kezachigalila mbuli zihile ng'hani kufosa viyatendile Abisalomu. Wasole wanhu wangu na mumuwinge. Sheba sekeyeze kuna bululu jojose dili na mhongono na kuchibanga.” <verse eid="2SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 20:7" />Ivo wanhu wa Yoabu na Wakelesi na Wapelesi hamwe na watowang'hondo magalu, wose wasegela hasi ya ulangulizi wa Abishai. Wasegela Yelusalemu muladi wamuwinze Sheba mwana wa Bikili. <verse eid="2SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 20:8" />Lusita viwakalile kuna uluwe lukulu uko Gibeoni, Amasa keza kuwahokela. Yoabu kakala kavala mawalo yake ya kuitowela ng'hondo na kaifunga mkwiji uli na yala muna ichigudi chake. Viyakalile kohita kuulongozi, mwele ulagala kulawa muna iyala yake. <verse eid="2SA 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 20:9" />Yoabu kamulongela Amasa, “Kwamgima ndugu yangu?” Maabaho Yoabu kamwamha Amasa ndevu kwa mkono wake wa kulume muladi yamnonele. <verse eid="2SA 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 20:10" />Mbali Amasa hauwone umwele ukalile muna mkono wa Yoabu, nayo Yoabu kamuhoma munda, utumbo wake ugwa hasi. Kadanganika bahaja. Yoabu halondeke kumuhoma mwanza wekaidi. Maabaho Yoabu na ndugu yake Abishai wamuwinza Sheba mwana wa Bikili. <verse eid="2SA 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 20:11" />Imwe wa walume wa Yoabu kema habehi nayo, kalonga, “Munhu yoyose yomulonda Yoabu na munhu yoyose yeli ubanzi wa Daudi, yamsondelele Yoabu!” <verse eid="2SA 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 20:12" />Amasa kakala katambalala muna idamu yake mudikulugumbi. Munhu imwe kawona kuwa yoyose yafosile haja kema na kulola. Munhu iyo viyavimanyile kuwa chila munhu kakala yokwima, kambulula Amasa kulawa hadikulugumbi mbaka kumgunda na kamgubika na walo. <verse eid="2SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 20:13" />Na viyasegezigwe muna dikulugumbi, wanhu wose wafosa na wamsondelela Yoabu muladi kumuwinza Sheba mwana wa Bikili. <verse eid="2SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 20:14" />Sheba kafosa muna iisi ya makabila yose ya Isilaili mbaka bululu da Abeli ya Besi Maaka na kufosa hanhu hose ha Wabikili waja waikunzagiza hamwe na kumsondelela. <verse eid="2SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 20:15" />Walume wose wowakalile na Yoabu weza na kumzunguluka Sheba mwana wa Bikili uko Abeli ya Besi Maaka. Watenda chisugulu na wakwela na wadizunguluka bululu kwa kwika mabumbila ya watowang'hondo, muladi wadahe kuitowa mhongono ya bululu ilagale. <verse eid="2SA 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 20:16" />Baho mwanamke imwe yeli na ubala muna dibululu kalandula dizi, kalonga, “Tegelezeni, tegelezeni! Mulongeleni Yoabu yeze hano habehi nilonge nayo.” <verse eid="2SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 20:17" />Yoabu kahita haulongozi wake, mwanamke iyo kamuuza, “Weye iyo Yoabu?” Yoabu kamwidika, “Iyo niye.” Mwanamke ija kamulongela, “Unitegeleze niye msang'hani wako chondanikulongele.” Yoabu kamulongela, “Notegeleza.” <verse eid="2SA 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 20:18" />Maabaho mwanamke ija kalonga, “Umwaka wanhu walonga, ‘Uhawa na mbuli ya kuuza, hita uko Abeli ukatazigwe,’ na ivo viwatendaga. <verse eid="2SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 20:19" />Cheye cha wanhu wa tindiwalo, chili waminika muna iisi ya Isilaili. Weye kolonda kudibananga bululu dikulu muna iisi ya Isilaili, habali kolonda kuwananga wanhu wa Mndewa Mulungu?” <verse eid="2SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 20:20" />Yoabu kamwidika, “Haidahika, sidaha kumnangani hebu kudinanga bululu. <verse eid="2SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 20:21" />Viulongile siyo kweli! Mbali munhu imwe zina jake Sheba mwana wa Bikili kulawa kuna iisi ya vilima va Efulaimu, kamulema mfalume Daudi. Nitulileni munhu ino na niye nizasegela bululu dino.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 20:21">Mwanamke ija kamulongela Yoabu, “Ditwi jake dizakwasigwa kufosela uchanyha ya ng'huta.” <verse eid="2SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 20:22" />Ivo mwanamke ija kahita kwa wanhu wose kuno kana gesa jake dinogile. Wawo wadumula ditwi da Sheba mwana wa Bikili na kumwasila Yoabu. Ivo Yoabu katowa mhalati na wanhu wake waimwaga, chila munhu kabwela ukaye yake. Maabaho Yoabu kabwela kwa mfalume uko Yelusalemu.<verse eid="2SA 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 20:23" />Yoabu kakala mkulu wa mabumbila yose ya watowang'hondo wa Isilaili. Benaya mwana wa Yehoyada kakala kowalanguliza Wakelesi na Wapelesi. <verse eid="2SA 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 20:24" />Adolamu kakala mulangulizi wa waja watendile sang'hano za kuwangilizigwa kwa mfalume. Yehoshafati mwana Ahiludi kakala mwikaji lukumbuso wa mfalume. <verse eid="2SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 20:25" />Sheva kakala mwandikaji, Sadoki na Abiasali wakala wakulu wa nhambiko, <verse eid="2SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 20:26" />iviya Ila Muyaili kakala mkulu wa nhambiko lusita viyatawale Daudi.<verse eid="2SA 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2SA 21" />
  <para style="s">Wagibeoni wolihiliza chisasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 21:1" />Kukala na nzala lusita wa Daudi miyaka mitatu dimwe kwa dimwe. Ivo Daudi kapula nhazo kwa Mndewa Mulungu. Mndewa Mulungu kalonga, “Sauli na kaye yake wabananga kwa kuwakoma Wagibeoni.” <verse eid="2SA 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 21:2" />Mfalume kawatanga Wagibeoni na kalonga nawo. Wagibeoni hawawile wana wa Isilaili bule, mbali wakala wasigale kulawa kwa Waamoli. Waisilaili wakala wailaha kuwaleka wagima. Mbali Sauli kageza kuwananga kwa ichimu cha migongo yake kwa Isilaili na Yuda. <verse eid="2SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 21:3" />Ivo Daudi kawauza Wagibeoni, “Niwatendeleni choni? Nizalihaze kwa wihi woutendiligwe, muladi mudahe kuitemela mate isi ino na wanhu wa Mndewa Mulungu?” <verse eid="2SA 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 21:4" />Wagibeoni wamwidika, “Mbuli ya Sauli na kaye yake siyo mbuli ya kulihigwa hela hebu zahabu, hebu si mbuli ya kukoma munhu yoyose muna iisi ya Isilaili.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:4">Daudi kawauza, “Lelo niwatendele choni?”<verse eid="2SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 21:5" />Wamwidika mfalume, “Sauli kachagiza na kuchitendela yehile ya kuchinanga, sekechikale hanhu hohose muna iisi ya Isilaili. <verse eid="2SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 21:6" />Chipatileni walume saba kulawa muna uwelesi wa Sauli, chiwakome haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu uko Gibea ya Sauli muna umulima wa Mndewa Mulungu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 21:6">Mfalume kawedika, “Nizawatula kumwenu.”<verse eid="2SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 21:7" />Mbali mfalume kamuwonela ubazi Mefiboshesi mwana wa Yonasani mzukulu wa Sauli kwa ichimu cha chilaho haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu kwa Daudi na Yonasani. <verse eid="2SA 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 21:8" />Mbali mfalume kamsola Alimoni na Mefiboshesi imwenga, wana waidi wa Lisipa mndele wa Aya iyo yakalile kamwelekela Sauli. Iviya kawasola wana watano wa Melabu mndele wa Sauli yoyamwelekele Adilieli mwana wa Balizilai, Mmeholasi, <verse eid="2SA 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 21:9" />na kawatula mmakono kwa Wagibeoni. Nawo wawakoma mchanyha ya mulima haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu. Na wose saba wadanganika hamwe muna isiku ya mwanduso ya kuhuna shayili.<verse eid="2SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 21:10" />Maabaho Lisipa mndele wa Aya, kasola viwalo va maguniya, katandika muna uluwe na kakala habehi na mitufi, kwandusila mwanduso wa kugobola mbaka viwatonyiligwe na mvula. Kawawinga ndege sekewakwenhukile mitufi imisi na ichilo kawawinga wanyama wa mbago. <verse eid="2SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 21:11" />Daudi viyahulike chiya chiyakalile yotenda Lisipa mndele wa Aya, muke mdodo wa Sauli, <verse eid="2SA 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 21:12" />kahita kusola mivuha ya Sauli na mwanage Yonasani kulawa kwa wanhu wa Yabeshi Gileadi. Wakala waisola kwa chifiso kulawa kudibuga da wanhu wose uko Besi Shani, hanhu baho Wafilisiti wakala wawatumbika siku yowamkomile Sauli uko Giliboa. <verse eid="2SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 21:13" />Daudi kaibweleza mivuha ya Sauli na Yonasani kulawa uko na iviya mivuha ya waja saba wowakomigwe. <verse eid="2SA 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 21:14" />Waiwanda mivuha ya Sauli na ya mwanage Yonasani kuna dileme da Kishi, tati yake Sauli uko Sela muna iisi ya Benyamini. Watenda chila chinhu mfalume chiyalagilize. Viyakomeleze yayo, Mulungu kayedika mapulo kwa ichimu cha isi.<verse eid="2SA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'hondo na Wafilisiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 21:15" />Maabaho kukala na ng'hondo kaidi na Wafilisiti na Waisilaili. Daudi na wanhu wake wahita kwiitowa na Wafilisiti, nayo kakala yalegele ng'hani kuing'hondo. <verse eid="2SA 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 21:16" />Imwe wa watowang'hondo wa Wafilisiti yatangigwe Ishibi Benobu wa welesi wa Walefai, kalonda kumkoma Daudi. Kakala na mgoha wili na nhonga ya shaba yili na nzamo ya chilo nhatu na nusu na panga da sambi. <verse eid="2SA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 21:17" />Mbali Abishai mwana wa Seluya keza na kamtaza Daudi, kamtowa Mfilisiti iyo na kamkoma. Baho wanhu wamulahila Daudi na walonga, “Weye huzahita kaidi kuing'hondo, sekewize kuutenda moto wa Isilaili kufa.”<verse eid="2SA 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 21:18" />Vilufosile lusita kukala na ng'hondo kaidi na Wafilisiti uko Gobu. Baho Sibekai Muhushahi kamkoma Safu imwe wa welesi wa Walefai. <verse eid="2SA 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 21:19" />Kukala na ng'hondo kaidi na Wafilisiti uko Gobu, Elihanani mwana wa Yaali Olegimu, kulawa Beselehemu kamkoma ndugu yake Goliati Mgiti na uwo mgoha wake ukala na muhini mkulu fana viya mbiki wa mbotaji mawalo. <verse eid="2SA 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 21:20" />Kukala na ng'hondo kaidi uko Gasi. Uko kukala na munhu mtali ng'hani yeli na vidole sita kwa chila mkono na vidole sita kwa chila mgulu, peta ya vidole vake ikala malongo maidi na vine. Iviya nayo kakala wa welesi wa Walefai. <verse eid="2SA 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 21:21" />Yeye iyo yawaligile Waisilaili, Yonasani mwana wa Shimei sekulu wake Daudi kamkoma.<verse eid="2SA 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 21:22" />Wawo wane wakala welesi wa Walefai uko Gasi, nawo wakomigwa na Daudi hamwe na watowang'hondo wake.<verse eid="2SA 21:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2SA 22" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa hewela wa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 22:1" />Daudi kamwimbila Mndewa Mulungu mbuli za wila uno, siku ija viyamulopole kulawa kwa wehi wake wose na iviya kulawa kwa Sauli.<verse eid="2SA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 22:2" />Daudi kemba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:2">“Mndewa Mulungu ni luwe lwangu na mhongono yangu na mulopozi wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 22:3" />Mulungu ni luwe lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">hanhu honikala goya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">Yeye ni ngao yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">na yonilopola kulawa kwa wanhu wasede.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">Iyo yeye mkombola wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:3">na koukaliza ugima wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 22:4" />“Nomulamba Mndewa Mulungu yofaya kwing'higwa nhogolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:4">na niye nilopoligwa kulawa kwa wehi wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 22:5" />Kwaviya ifa inizunguluka fana viya mawimbi yanigubika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:5">unango unikwenhukila himahima fana mazi mengi yoyokuluma.<verse eid="2SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 22:6" />Nzabi kulawa kuzimu zinizunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:6">mitego ya ifa ininamata.<verse eid="2SA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 22:7" />“Muna yamanhesa yangu nimtanga Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">nimulamba Mulungu wangu yanitaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">nayo kahulika dizi jangu muna ikaye yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:7">na kahulika vinimpulile yanitaze.<verse eid="2SA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 22:8" />Isi igudemeka na itingisika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:8">vandusilo va kuulanga vigudemeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:8">vigudemeka kwaviya Mulungu kawona ludoko.<verse eid="2SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 22:9" />Yosi difuka kulawa muna imhula yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:9">moto woulunguza ulawa muna umulomo wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:9">makala ya moto yazipuka kulawa kumwake.<verse eid="2SA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 22:10" />Kaunamiza ulanga na kahulumuka hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:10">kukala na wingu titu hasi ya magulu yake.<verse eid="2SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 22:11" />Kakwela mchanyha ya chilumbe chilingile fana msenga wa kuulanga, kazumha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:11">Nayo kaguluka mchanyha ya beho fana mabawa.<verse eid="2SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 22:12" />Kaigubika ziza banzi zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:12">kazungulukigwa na mawingu yazamile yamemile mazi.<verse eid="2SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 22:13" />Kulawa kuna dibung'hulo dikalile kuulongozi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:13">makala ya moto yabwinhingwa.<verse eid="2SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 22:14" />Mndewa Mulungu kaduma kulawa kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:14">dizi da Yeli Uchanyha Ng'hani dihulikika.<verse eid="2SA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 22:15" />Kawatowa misale yake wehi na kawapwililisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:15">na lumwemwe lukulu luwatimula.<verse eid="2SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 22:16" />Kolongo da mazi diwoneka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">na vandusilo va isi vigubuligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">kwa kubwakila kwake Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:16">kwa luvumo wa mhumuzi ya mhula yake.<verse eid="2SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 22:17" />“Kagolosa mkono kulawa mchanyha na kunyamha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:17">kanilava kulawa hana yamazi mengi.<verse eid="2SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 22:18" />Kanilopola na mwihi wangu yeli na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:18">yeli na nguvu ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:18">kanilopola kulawa kwa waja wanihile wakalile na nguvu kufosa niye.<verse eid="2SA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 22:19" />Wanizila lusita vinikalile na magayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:19">mbali Mndewa Mulungu kanikaliza.<verse eid="2SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 22:20" />Kanigala hanhu hanogile kukala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:20">kanilopola kwaviya kanogeligwa na niye.<verse eid="2SA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 22:21" />“Mndewa Mulungu kanitendela mbuli zinogile, kwaviya notenda voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:21">koniliha gweko kwaviya niye nabule ubananzi.<verse eid="2SA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 22:22" />Nisondelela nzila zake Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:22">na simulekile Mulungu wangu hebu kutenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="2SA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 22:23" />Nogesa ndagilizi zake lusita lwose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:23">na siyalekile malagilizo yake yose.<verse eid="2SA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 22:24" />Niwa nabule ubananzi haulongozi wa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:24">na niikaliza sekenitende uhasanyi.<verse eid="2SA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 22:25" />Mndewa Mulungu kaniliha kwa kutenda voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:25">kwaviya kovimanya kuwa nabule ubananzi.<verse eid="2SA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 22:26" />“Weye Mndewa Mulungu kwa mwaminika kwa wanhu wokwaminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:26">kwa welibule ubananzi koilagusa kuwa kwabule ubananzi.<verse eid="2SA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 22:27" />Kwa ija yelile koilagusa kuwa kela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:27">mbali kwa ija mbalabala koilagusa mbala kufosa yeye.<verse eid="2SA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 22:28" />Weye kowalopola wanyendanyenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:28">mbali meso yako yowalema weli na magoda muladi uwahulumuse.<verse eid="2SA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 22:29" />Kwaviya weye ni wenge jangu, weye Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:29">Mndewa Mulungu kotenda ziza jangu kuwa bung'hulo.<verse eid="2SA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 22:30" />Kwa kutazigwa na weye, nodaha kudihuma bumbila da watowang'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:30">kwa kutazigwa na Mulungu wangu nodaha kuzumha ng'huta.<verse eid="2SA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 22:31" />“Mulungu, nzila yako igoloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">Mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu izalawilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">weye ni ngao kwa wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:31">wose wokukimbilia uwataze.<verse eid="2SA 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 22:32" />Yelihi yeli Mulungu, mbali ni Mndewa Mulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:32">Yelihi yeli luwe, ila ni Mulungu wetu?<verse eid="2SA 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 22:33" />Mulungu ni mhongono yangu ili na igangamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:33">nayo kowalongoza wanhu goya kuna inzila igoloke.<verse eid="2SA 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 22:34" />Koyatenda magulu yangu fana magulu ya ng'hulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:34">konidahiza kwima mchanyha ya milima.<verse eid="2SA 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 22:35" />Koyafundiza makono yangu kuitowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:35">muladi niwe na nguvu ya kusang'hanila upinde wa shaba.<verse eid="2SA 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 22:36" />Kuning'ha ngao yako ya ulopozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:36">nhazo yako initenda niwe mkulu.<verse eid="2SA 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 22:37" />Kuitenda nzila yangu iwe ngalamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:37">na sambi sizatelebuka bule.<verse eid="2SA 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 22:38" />“Niwawinga wehi wangu mbaka niwahuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:38">na sibwelile mbaka viwanangigwe.<verse eid="2SA 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 22:39" />Niwakomeleza na kuwananga sekewadahe kwima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:39">wagwa hasi ya magulu yangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="2SA 22:40" />Kuning'ha nguvu za kutowa ng'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:40">kuwatenda wehi wangu wanyolile haulongozi wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2SA 22:41" />Kuwatenda wehi wangu wakimbile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:41">nowananga waja wowonihila.<verse eid="2SA 22:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2SA 22:42" />Wamzahila munhu wa kuwalopola, mbali hawampatile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:42">na wampula Mndewa Mulungu, mbali hawedike.<verse eid="2SA 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="2SA 22:43" />Niwatowa wakala lunhili fana viya matimbwisi ya isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:43">niwahonda na kuwabojoga fana nhope ya mzila.<verse eid="2SA 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="2SA 22:44" />“Kunilopola kulawa kwa kuitowa na wanhu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:44">kunika goya niwe mtawala wa wanhu wa zisi zimwenga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:44">Wanhu siwamanyile wezanisang'hanila.<verse eid="2SA 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="2SA 22:45" />Nyambenyambe wanizila kuno wainyendanyenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:45">viwanihulike mbuli zangu wanitegeleza.<verse eid="2SA 22:45" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="2SA 22:46" />Nyambenyambe nawo wamalilwa na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:46">Walawa muna zimhongono zawo kuno wogudemeka.<verse eid="2SA 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="2SA 22:47" />“Mndewa Mulungu mgima! Nhogolwa kwa luwe lwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:47">yatogolwe Mulungu wangu, luwe lwa ulopozi wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="2SA 22:48" />Yeye niiyo Mulungu yolihiliza chisasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:48">na kuzika zisi zose muna utawala wangu.<verse eid="2SA 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="2SA 22:49" />Na kunikaliza niye kulawa kwa wehi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:49">kuninula uchanyha ya wehi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:49">kunilopola kulawa kwa wanhu wehile.<verse eid="2SA 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="2SA 22:50" />Ivo nizakutogola weye Mndewa Mulungu muna iisi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:50">Niye nizakwimba nhogolwa ya zina jako.<verse eid="2SA 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="2SA 22:51" />Mulungu komwing'ha mfalume wake uhumi mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:51">komulagusa ulondo wake mfalume yoyamsagule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 22:51">komulagusa ulondo wake Daudi na welesi wake siku zose.”<verse eid="2SA 22:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2SA 23" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli za uhelelo za Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 23:1" />Zino niizo mbuli za uhelelo za Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:1">“Mbuli za Daudi mwana wa Yese,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:1">munhu yatendigwe kuwa mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:1">yoyasaguligwe na Mulungu wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:1">mtungaji nyila zinogile za Isilaili.<verse eid="2SA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 23:2" />“Muhe wa Mndewa Mulungu ulonga kufosela niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:2">mbuli yake ikala muna umulomo wangu.<verse eid="2SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 23:3" />Mulungu yeli luwe lwa Isilaili kanilongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">‘Yoyotawala wanhu viya viilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:3">na yoyotawala kwa kumdumba Mulungu,<verse eid="2SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 23:4" />yeye kalinga fana viya mhwani yau zuwa vidilawa imitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:4">imitondo ilibule mawingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:4">fana mvula yoyokoteza mayani muisi.’<verse eid="2SA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 23:5" />“Vino haili ivo kwa welesi wangu haulongozi wa Mulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">Kwaviya katenda na niye lagano da siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">dodikigwe goya na kugangamizigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">Kezanitenda niudeng'helele ulopozi wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:5">na kuninogela chiya chinilonda.<verse eid="2SA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 23:6" />Mbali wanhu wehi wezakwasigwa mumgwazo fana miwa ya mbago viikwasigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:6">kwaviya haiduganyigwa kwa makono.<verse eid="2SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 23:7" />Munhu yondayadalise miwa iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:7">yasang'hanile chiya cha chuma hebu muhini wa mgoha.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2SA 23:7">Miwa izanangigwa bahobaho kwa moto na wanhu wehi ivo ivo.”<verse eid="2SA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Magalu wa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 23:8" />Yano niyayo mazina ya magalu woyakalile nawo Daudi. Yoshebu Bashebesi, Mhakimoni, yoyakalile mulangulizi wa waja watatu wakalile magalu wa watowang'hondo. Yeye katowa ng'hondo na mgoha wake na kawakoma wanhu magana manane kwa lusita lumwe kwiing'hondo.<verse eid="2SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 23:9" />Wekaidi wake kakala Eleazali mwana wa Dodo mwana wa Ahohi. Yeli mwa iwaja magalu watatu wowakalile hamwe na Daudi, viwawaligile Wafilisiti wakalile waiduganya uko muladi kwiitowa. Na watowang'hondo wa Waisilaili wakimbila. <verse eid="2SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 23:10" />Mbali Eleazali kema chigangamavu na kawakoma Wafilisiti mbaka mkono wake ulegela na ugendelela kwamhilila zele jake. Mndewa Mulungu kaweng'ha uhumi mkulu siku iyo. Mabumbila ya watowang'hondo ya Waisilaili yabwela kwa Eleazali kusola vinhu va Wafilisiti wakalile wadanganika.<verse eid="2SA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 23:11" />Galu imwenga kakala Shama mwana wa Agi Mhalali. Wafilisiti viwaiduganye uko Lehi, hanhu hakalile mgunda umemile dengu, mabumbila ya watowang'hondo wa Isilaili wawakimbila Wafilisiti. <verse eid="2SA 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 23:12" />Mbali Shama kema chigangamavu muludonho wa mgunda uwo muladi kuugombela, nayo kawakoma Wafilisiti. Mndewa Mulungu kawapatila uhumi mkulu.<verse eid="2SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 23:13" />Lusita lwa kugobola, magalu watatu muna iwakulu wa watowang'hondo malongo matatu wahita kwa Daudi muna dituka da Adulamu na lusita ulwo bumbila da watowang'hondo da Wafilisiti wakala weka lago jawo muna dibawe da Lefaimu. <verse eid="2SA 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 23:14" />Lusita ulwo Daudi kakala muna dituka, bumbila da Wafilisiti dikala kudibululu da Beselehemu. <verse eid="2SA 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 23:15" />Daudi kakala na ng'hilu, kalonga, “Nolonda munhu yaning'he mazi ya kung'wa kulawa inzasa ili habehi na lwivi lukulu lwa kwingilila Beselehemu!” <verse eid="2SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 23:16" />Mbali magalu wawo watatu waibebenyeka kuna dilago da watowang'hondo wa Wafilisiti na kudeha mazi muna ichisima chiya chili habehi na hanhu ha kwingilila Beselehemu. Wamgalila Daudi, mbali Daudi kalema kuyang'wa na kayetila hasi kuwa nhosa kwa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="2SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 23:17" />Daudi kalonga, “Sidaha kung'wa mazi yano, weye Mndewa Mulungu. Mazi yano yalinga fana damu ya magalu wano hawadumbile kudanganika kwa kunigalila mazi niye.” Ivo Daudi hayang'wile.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 23:17">Yayo ni yayo yawatendile waja magalu watatu.<verse eid="2SA 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 23:18" />Kaidi Abishai mdodo wake Yoabu mami yawo katangigwa Seluya kakala mulangulizi wa bumbila da magalu malongo matatu. Iyo kawakoma na mgoha wake wanhu 300. Nayo kawa na nhogolwa fana waja magalu watatu. <verse eid="2SA 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 23:19" />Kamanyika ng'hani mwa iwaja malongo matatu na kawa mulangulizi wawo, mbali hapetigwe mwa iwaja magalu watatu.<verse eid="2SA 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 23:20" />Benaya mwana wa Yehoyada kakala mtowang'hondo galu kulawa Kabiseeli, katenda mbuli nyingi za ugalu. Kawakoma magalu waidi wakalile magalu kufosa wose wa Moabu. Siku dimwe kahumuluka muna dikombo dikalile seluji na kamkoma simba. <verse eid="2SA 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 23:21" />Iviya kamkoma Mmisili yakalile mtali. Mmisili iyo kakala na mgoha mmakono, mbali Benaya kamgendela na mhome na kumuhoka Mmisili mgoha mmakono yake na kamkoma kwa mgoha wake mwenyewo. <verse eid="2SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 23:22" />Zino zikala mbuli za ugalu wa Benaya mwana wa Yehoyada, nayo iviya kakala yamanyike ng'hani fana waja magalu watatu. <verse eid="2SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 23:23" />Kapata hishima ng'hani kufosa waja malongo matatu, mbali hapetigwe mwa iwaja magalu watatu. Daudi kamwika kuwa mkulu wa wakalizi wake mwenyewo.<verse eid="2SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 23:24" />Mwaiwawo malongo matatu wakala Asaheli mdodo wake Yoabu na Elihanani mwana wa Dodo kulawa Beselehemu <verse eid="2SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 23:25" />na Shama Mhalodi na Elika Mhalodi <verse eid="2SA 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2SA 23:26" />na Helesi kulawa Paliti na Ila mwana Ikeshi kulawa Tekoa <verse eid="2SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2SA 23:27" />na Abiezeli kulawa Anasosi na Mebunai kulawa Hushahi <verse eid="2SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2SA 23:28" />na Salimoni Mwahohi na Mahalai kulawa Netofasi <verse eid="2SA 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2SA 23:29" />na Helebi mwana wa Baana kulawa Netofasi na Itayi mwana wa Libai kulawa Gibea wawo wa kabila da Benyamini <verse eid="2SA 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2SA 23:30" />na Benaya wa uko Pilasoni na Hidayi kulawa habehi na vizanda va Gaashi <verse eid="2SA 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2SA 23:31" />na Abi Aliboni Mwalaba na Azimavesi wa uko Bahulimi <verse eid="2SA 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2SA 23:32" />na Eliaba wa uko Shaaliboni na wanage Yasheni na Yonasani <verse eid="2SA 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2SA 23:33" />na Shama kulawa Halali na Ahiamu mwana wa Shalali kulawa Halali <verse eid="2SA 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2SA 23:34" />na Elifeleti mwana wa Ahasabai kulawa Maakasi na Eliamu mwana wa Ahitofeli kulawa Giloni <verse eid="2SA 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2SA 23:35" />na Hezilo kulawa Kalimeli na Paalai kulawa Alibi <verse eid="2SA 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2SA 23:36" />na Igali mwana wa Nasani kulawa Soba na Bani kulawa kabila da Gadi <verse eid="2SA 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2SA 23:37" />na Seleki Mwamoni na Nahalai yolawa Beelosi yakalile mpagazi wa via va ng'hondo va Yoabu mwana wa mwanamke Seluya <verse eid="2SA 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2SA 23:38" />na Ila Muisilite na Galebu Muisilite <verse eid="2SA 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2SA 23:39" />na Uliya Muhiti. Magalu wose hamwe na wano malongo matatu, wakala malongo matatu na saba.<verse eid="2SA 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2SA 24" />
  <para style="s">Daudi kowapeta watowang'hondo wa Isilaili na Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2SA 24:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kawawonela ludoko kaidi Waisilaili na kamtenda Daudi kuwagalila magayo. Kamulongela, “Hita ukawapete wanhu wa Isilaili na wanhu wa Yuda.”<verse eid="2SA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2SA 24:2" />Ivo mfalume kamulongela Yoabu mkulu wa watowang'hondo hamwe na waja wakalile hamwe nayo, “Zunguluka ivino sambi muna yamakabila yose ya Isilaili, kwandusila Dani mbaka Belisheba mukawapete watowang'hondo muladi nivimanye wengahi.”<verse eid="2SA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2SA 24:3" />Mbali Yoabu kamwidika mfalume, “Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako, yongeze wanhu miyanza gana mfalume yang'hali mgima. Mbali habali mwenevale wangu kolonda kutenda mbuli ino?”<verse eid="2SA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2SA 24:4" />Mbuli ya mfalume imuhuma Yoabu na walangulizi wa watowang'hondo, ivo wasegela kwa mfalume na wandusila kuwapeta watowang'hondo wa Isilaili. <verse eid="2SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2SA 24:5" />Viwakomeleze kuloka Yoludani, weka lago uko Aloeli, ubanzi wa kusi wa bululu dili hagati ya bawe, kusonhela Gadi na Yazeli. <verse eid="2SA 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2SA 24:6" />Wahita bululu da Kadeshi muna iisi ya Gileadi, yili iisi ya Wahiti. Wagendelela mbaka Dani Yaani na kuzunguluka kusonhela Sidoni. <verse eid="2SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2SA 24:7" />Maabaho wahita kusonhela mhongono ya Tilo hamwe na mabululu yose ya Wahivi na ya Wakanaani, wahita mbaka Belisheba mbaka ubanzi wa kusi wa Yuda. <verse eid="2SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2SA 24:8" />Viwakomeleze kufosa isi yose, wabwela Yelusalemu viimalile miyezi kenda na siku malongo maidi. <verse eid="2SA 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2SA 24:9" />Yoabu kalava peta ya watowang'hondo kwa mfalume. Muna Isilaili kukala wanhu 800,000 weli na udahi wa kuitowa na muna isi ya Yuda kukala wanhu 500,000.<verse eid="2SA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi kotagusigwa kwa uhasanyi wake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2SA 24:10" />Daudi moyo wake unyunguwala viyakomeleze kuwapeta watowang'hondo, nayo kamulongela Mndewa Mulungu, “Nitenda uhasanyi mkulu kwa chiya chinitendile. Lelo nokupula weye Mndewa Mulungu, unisegezele ubananzi uno niye msang'hani wako. Nitenda mbuli za ubozi.” <verse eid="2SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2SA 24:11" />Na Daudi viyalamke imitondo, mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu imwizila Gadi yoyomulotela Daudi na kalonga, <verse eid="2SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2SA 24:12" />“Hita ukamulongele Daudi, Mndewa Mulungu kolonga vino, ‘Nina mbuli nhatu za kukulongela, weye usagule imwe na niye nizatenda.’ ” <verse eid="2SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2SA 24:13" />Ivo Gadi kahita kwa Daudi, kamulongela, “Vino kwizasagula miyaka mitatu ya nzala muna iisi yose hebu miyezi mitatu ya kuwakimbila wehi wako hebu siku nhatu za hulo kulu muna iisi yako? Ugese na unilongele chiusagule muladi nimulongele Mndewa Mulungu yanitumile.” <verse eid="2SA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2SA 24:14" />Daudi kamulongela Gadi, “Nina usungu ng'hani, lelo silonda kutagusigwa na wanhu mbali muleke Mndewa Mulungu yeye mwenyewo yachitaguse kwaviya kana ubazi ng'hani.” <verse eid="2SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2SA 24:15" />Mndewa Mulungu kawagalila hulo muna iisi ya Isilaili imitondo ija ija na kugendelela kwa siku nhatu. Wanhu 70,000 wadanganika uko Dani mbaka uko Belisheba. <verse eid="2SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2SA 24:16" />Msenga wa kuulanga kagolosa mkono wake muladi kuinanga Yelusalemu mbali Mndewa Mulungu kagalula choyailungile kutenda muumoyo wake kuwatagusa wanhu. Kamulongela ija msenga yoyakalile yowananga wanhu, “Leka! Yofaya, bweleza mkono wako.” Lusita ulwo msenga wa kuulanga kakala hana ihanhu ha kubigila ndiya ha Alauna Myebusi. <verse eid="2SA 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2SA 24:17" />Daudi viyamuwone msenga wa kuulanga iyo yowakoma, kamulongela Mndewa Mulungu, “Niye nihasanya na nitenda chinhu chino chihile. Wanhu wano walinga fana ng'hondolo. Watenda choni? Nitaguse niye na welesi wangu.”<verse eid="2SA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Daudi komzengela Mulungu lupango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2SA 24:18" />Siku iyo Gadi kamuhitila Daudi na kumulongela, “Hita ukamzengele Mndewa Mulungu lupango hana ihanhu ha kuhululila ha Alauna Myebusi.” <verse eid="2SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2SA 24:19" />Ivo Daudi kahita fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulongele kufosela Gadi. <verse eid="2SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2SA 24:20" />Alauna viyawawone mfalume na wasang'hani wake womwizila, kalawa kunze na kamtumbalila mavindi mbaka chihanga chake chidalisa hasi.<verse eid="2SA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2SA 24:21" />Alauna kalonga, “Mwenevale wangu mfalume kamwizila msang'hani wake kwa lungilo dilihi?” Daudi kalonga, “Niza kugula hanhu hako ha kubigila ndiya nimzengele lupango Mndewa Mulungu, muladi hulo dino dileke kukoma wanhu.”<verse eid="2SA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2SA 24:22" />Alauna kamulongela Daudi, “Mwenevale wangu mfalume, usole chochose chochikunogela na uchilave nhambiko. Hano hana ng'ombe wa kulimila kwa ichimu cha nhambiko ya kutimbula, iviya kuna mibiki ya kubigila na mibiki ya kufungila ng'ombe muisingo kwa ichimu cha ngodi. <verse eid="2SA 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2SA 24:23" />Niye nokwing'ha vinhu vino vose.” Maabaho Alauna kamulongela mfalume, “Mndewa Mulungu wako yakutogole.”<verse eid="2SA 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2SA 24:24" />Mbali mfalume kamwidika Alauna, “Siivo, nokanhamiza kuvilihila kumwako kwa hela yoilondeka. Sidaha kumulavila Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wangu nhambiko za kutimbula sizilihile chochose.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2SA 24:24">Ivo Daudi kagula hanhu ha kuhululila hamwe na ng'ombe kwa shekeli za hela malongo matano. <verse eid="2SA 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2SA 24:25" />Daudi kamzengela Mndewa Mulungu lupango uko na kulava nhambiko za kutimbula na nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo. Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kedika chiyampulile kwa ichimu cha isi. Hulo dimala muna iisi ya Isilaili.<verse eid="2SA 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2SA 24" />
</usx>